-- Quests: the English titles, texts and objectives left empty are filled from TrinityCore's 7.3.5 data, then 12.1, then Wowhead
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Call of Earth', `LogDescription` = 'Bring 2 applications of Ritual Salve to Seer Ravenfeather in Camp Narache.', `QuestDescription` = 'The time has come, young $c. Your body ages and grows strong, and your spirit endures like the earth. I see it within you-you have wisdom already.$B$BThe earth guides our people, and it speaks to us, as it will to you in time. But you must be tested. If you are ready, then you shall see things only our kind know of.$B$BSeek out the Bristleback shamans in their ravine to the east, and take from them a salve they use in their rituals. Return to me only when you have enough for your own potion.' WHERE `ID` = 1519;
