UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on Shattrath Harbor', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Sargerei forces at Shattrath City in Talador.', `QuestDescription` = 'Shattrath City is in the hands of Sargerei forces under the leadership of the once Exarch, Socrethar.\n\nThe Shadow Council forces in the eastern portion of the city are gaining in power through the aid of demons from the Nether, and need to be culled before they become a threat to all of our operations.' WHERE `ID` = 36667;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on Stonefury Cliffs', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Bloodmaul ogres at Stonefury Cliffs in Frostfire Ridge.', `QuestDescription` = 'Bloodmaul ogres from Frostfire Ridge have been ambushing trade routes throughout the continent, and are putting captured soldiers to work in their slag mines.\n\nShadow Hunter Rokhan has requested the rescue of friendly troops that have been taken prisoner in the main Bloodmaul compound at Stonefury Cliffs.' WHERE `ID` = 36669;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on the Iron Siegeworks', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Iron Horde forces at the Iron Siegeworks in Frostfire Ridge.', `QuestDescription` = 'Iron Horde war machines are being shipped onto battlefields by the dozens, and our forces are struggling to hold their ground. Most of these machines seem to be originating from the Iron Siegeworks in eastern Frostfire Ridge.\n\nA strategic attack to disrupt and dismantle the Iron Horde at the siegeworks could be just what we need to turn the tide of the war.' WHERE `ID` = 36674;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on Magnarok', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the stone monstrosities at Magnarok in Frostfire Ridge.', `QuestDescription` = 'Colossal magnaron, gronn, and other stone monstrosities have been threatening our outposts in the west. Most seem to originate from Magnarok in Frostfire Ridge.\n\nIf we strike at them at their home, we should be able to force them back. It\'s risky, but it may be our best move. While you\'re there, see if you can recover any of our supplies.' WHERE `ID` = 36675;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on the Everbloom Wilds', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the botani forces in the Everbloom Wilds of Gorgrond.', `QuestDescription` = 'Botani and the plant monstrosities they conjure have been slowly encroaching on our outposts in the north. For every plant we kill, new ones seem to rise in its place.\n\nBodrick Grey has put together a plan for striking at the heart of their lands, in Everbloom Wilds. He thinks this will draw them back into the wilds of Gorgrond, giving us more room to maneuver around them.' WHERE `ID` = 36676;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on the Broken Precipice', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the ogron forces at the Broken Precipice in Nagrand.', `QuestDescription` = 'Massive ogron have been battering our frontlines, and no matter how many we down, there seem to be more to replace them.\n\nMost of these ogron appear to be coming from the Broken Precipice, deep in western Nagrand. If we\'re to stand a chance in the coming battles, we need to find a way to remove these ogron from the battlefield.' WHERE `ID` = 36677;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on Mok\'gol Watchpost', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Warsong forces at Mok\'gol Watchpost in Nagrand.', `QuestDescription` = 'Warsong raiders out of Mok\'gol Watchpost have been terrorizing anything and everything not behind a tall wall. We\'ve warned travelers not to stray out alone, but many don\'t listen.\n\nIf we were to launch an assault on Mok\'gol Watchpost, we would almost certainly put the Warsong back on the defensive, restricting most of their riders to Nagrand.' WHERE `ID` = 36678;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on Darktide Roost', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Iron Horde forces at Darktide Roost in Shadowmoon Valley.', `QuestDescription` = 'There\'s been a resurgence of rylaks on the battlefield in our skirmishes against the Iron Horde. If we don\'t stop them at the source, we\'ll quickly lose control of the roads and be pushed back into our outposts.\n\nThe most likely source of these additional rylaks is in southeastern Shadowmoon Valley, at Darktide Roost. If we move quickly, we should still have time to get ahead of the problem.' WHERE `ID` = 36679;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on Socrethar\'s Rise', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Sargerei forces at Socrethar\'s Rise in Shadowmoon Valley.', `QuestDescription` = 'Recent reports suggest a notable rise of activity by Sargerei forces at Socrethar\'s Rise in southern Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nSocrathar\'s disciples pose a threat to draenei and our garrison alike. We need to quell them at our soonest convenience.' WHERE `ID` = 36680;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on Lost Veil Anzu', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the hostile creatures at Lost Veil Anzu in Spires of Arak.', `QuestDescription` = 'Some of our best scouts have gone missing in the vicinity of the lost ruins of Veil Anzu.\n\nBodrick Grey has requested any available resources be dispatched to identify the threat and see if any of our men yet remain alive within the ruins.' WHERE `ID` = 36681;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on Pillars of Fate', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Shadowmoon orcs at Pillars of Fate in Shadowmoon Valley.', `QuestDescription` = 'Remnants of the Shadowmoon clan continue to operate out of the peaks on the eastern border of Spires of Arak.\n\nBodrick Grey is concerned at their proximity to the garrison, and has put out a request that we thin their forces as soon as possible.' WHERE `ID` = 36682;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on Skettis', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Adherents of Rukhmar at Skettis in Spires of Arak.', `QuestDescription` = 'We\'ve been receiving regular reports of birdmen from the south ambushing and burning caravans along the main roads.\n\nGuards from our outposts are requesting that we launch a counter attack against the main presence of Adherents of Rukhmar at Skettis in Spires of Arak.' WHERE `ID` = 36683;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Battle in Ashran', `LogDescription` = 'Join the battle in Ashran.', `QuestDescription` = 'As we do battle all across Draenor, the cowardly Horde try to seize our territory within Ashran.\n\nOur men would be inspired to see you join the battlefield, striking terror into the hearts of the Horde.' WHERE `ID` = 36684;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on the Heart of Shattrath', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Sargerei forces deep within Shattrath City in Talador.', `QuestDescription` = 'Sargerei forces from deep in Shattrath have grown stronger and bolder by the day. We can no longer risk ignoring the threat that they pose.\n\nBring allies if you wish to face the Sargerei so deep within the city.' WHERE `ID` = 36685;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Assault on the Pit', `LogDescription` = 'Assault the Blackrock orcs at the Pit in Gorgrond.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Blackrock forces based out of the Pit in Gorgrond make up the bulk of the Iron Horde army. If we crush them on their home soil, the rest of the Iron Horde will have little hope of standing against us.\n\nIf you choose the battle, bring friends. The Blackrock won\'t be defeated easily.' WHERE `ID` = 36686;
