UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Garrison Campaign: In the Shadows', `LogDescription` = 'Kill $1oa Council Nightblades within Lion\'s Watch.', `QuestDescription` = 'I need your help. Iskar has gone missing. I have reason to believe he has followed the remnants of the Sethekk who have been gathering here in Tanaan. I\'ve been investigating and... what was that?$b$b<Reshad\'s voice drops to a whisper>$b$bThere is movement in the shadows, we are being watched!$b$bTake these vials, they form a gas with a terrible smell when the liquid comes in contact with the air. Smells terrible, they won\'t be able to resist it. Use them to drive our watchers out of hiding.' WHERE `ID` = 37687;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Garrison Campaign: In the Shadows', `LogDescription` = 'Kill $1oa Council Nightblades within Vol\'mar.', `QuestDescription` = 'I need your help. Iskar has gone missing. I have reason to believe he has followed the remnants of the Sethekk who have been gathering here in Tanaan. I\'ve been investigating and... what was that?$b$b<Reshad\'s voice drops to a whisper>$b$bThere is movement in the shadows, we are being watched!$b$bTake these vials, they form a gas with a terrible smell when the liquid comes in contact with the air. Smells terrible, they won\'t be able to resist it. Use them to drive our watchers out of hiding.' WHERE `ID` = 37688;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Imposter', `LogDescription` = 'Grapple up the Lion\'s Rest cliffs, sneak through Stormwind City to the SI:7 courtyard, and then kill Detheroc.', `QuestDescription` = 'Detheroc has SI:7\'s finest snipers on all of the rooftops. We can\'t mount up and we can\'t fly. There are grapple points above so that we can move up the cliff. \n\nWe\'ve also setup hay bales to hide in along the likely routes to SI:7. We just need to stealth in and kill Detheroc.\n\nOnce we get up there, we\'ll separate to increase the chances of at least one of us making it through the city.\n\nGood luck, $n.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Return to Taoshi in the Chamber of Shadows.' WHERE `ID` = 37689;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Those Who Remember', `LogDescription` = 'Locate Nightwatcher Idri in the Drowned Gardens.', `QuestDescription` = 'The ghostly elves, to the south, once had the Pillar of Creation known as the Tidestone of Golganneth.$b$bTheir great city of Nar\'thalas was destroyed an eon ago. The city\'s ruler, Prince Farondis, fell with the city. You small ones die so easily.$b$bIf anyone knows where the fragments rest, it will be the ghost of the prince. Seek out his people.' WHERE `ID` = 37690;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = '[DEPRECATED]The Ancient One' WHERE `ID` = 37691;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure Goblin' WHERE `ID` = 37697;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Azsuna - Treasure 002 - El\'dranil Tablet' WHERE `ID` = 37713;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Valiyaka the Stormbringer' WHERE `ID` = 37726;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Magister of Mixology', `LogDescription` = 'Collect $1oa Arcane-Infused Eggs.', `QuestDescription` = 'As you must know, I\'m a connoisseur of drinks... specifically, arcane-infused spirits. Cocktail mixing is alchemy, and as everyone knows, alchemy is magic.\n\nMy latest drink must be more exotic than anything I\'ve conjured before. I already have most of what I need. But there are a couple of items left on the list.\n\nNotice the herons down in the lagoon? As with many of the creatures on Azsuna, the magic coursing through the island permeates them.\n\nTheir eggs will do nicely.' WHERE `ID` = 37727;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Presentation is Everything', `LogDescription` = 'Collect the Six Eyes of Gangamesh.', `QuestDescription` = 'The eggs will provide the \'oomph\' to my drink\'s character. But there\'s another element, and this must not be underestimated!\n\nPresentation.\n\nNow, you could go with your standard olive skewered on a toothpick. Maybe a carrot stalk stuck slapdash out of a glass.\n\nBut then, you wouldn\'t be me.\n\nNo, my friend. What MY drink needs to sell it visually comes from a one-of-a-kind creature. I\'m only going to serve it once and so my drink deserves something unique.\n\nThe eyes of Gangamesh are what I need.', `PortraitGiverText` = 'Magister Garuhod wants all six of this beast\'s eyes to top off his latest, greatest cocktail.', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Gangamesh' WHERE `ID` = 37728;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Pop Quiz: Advanced Rune Drawing', `LogDescription` = 'Trace an arcane rune, a fire rune, and a frost rune.', `QuestDescription` = 'Still aching to get into the headmistress\' study, eh? I suppose I can let you in... as long as you prove that you\'ve been studying.$b$bProper rune formation is essential when it comes to spellcasting. If you can draw a rune, you can cast a spell.$b$bI will provide outlines for you. You can simply use your feet to trace the runes.' WHERE `ID` = 37729;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Headmistress\' Keys', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain the Tidestone Vault Key from Elya Azuremoon, the Academy Headmistress.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have a suspicion you are avoiding your studies - but I can see you\'re anxious to see the Headmistress.$b$bVery well! Headmistress Azuremoon can be found up ahead, though I doubt she will enjoy being interrupted.' WHERE `ID` = 37730;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Prince Farondis', `LogDescription` = 'Meet up with Nightwatcher Idri at the Crumbled Palace.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'m glad to see that my doubts in you were unfounded.$b$bYou seek Prince Farondis? Follow me. I will show you to the prince\'s hall.' WHERE `ID` = 37733;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Dressing With Class', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain a Nar\'thalas Academy Hat, Robes, Wand, and Spellbook.', `QuestDescription` = 'Now stop right there. Look at you! You look like you just walked in off of the street. Where are your robes and hat?$b$bAnd don\'t tell me you\'ve entered the academy without your wand and spellbook.$b$bFreshmen.$b$bPut yourself together, and maybe then I will consider letting you enter the academy.' WHERE `ID` = 37736;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Trials of Khadgar: Iron Maidens', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat the Iron Maidens encounter, with the following conditions.', `QuestDescription` = 'Defeat your enemies with greater skill to earn the favor of Khadgar - and with it, greater rewards!' WHERE `ID` = 37749;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Professions Active' WHERE `ID` = 37750;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Bounties Active' WHERE `ID` = 37751;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Pet Battles Active' WHERE `ID` = 37752;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Relic Hunter Active' WHERE `ID` = 37753;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Walled City: Brackenspore', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Brackenspore in Highmaul.', `QuestDescription` = 'If it ain\'t one threat, it\'s another - I swear this light-forsaken world would try to eat us alive even without no Horde to fight.$b$bBrackenspore, ancient walker of the deep, was drawn from the waters near Highmaul by the presence of the Iron Horde. That thing is already spreading like a disease, $n. Ye got to put it down!$b$bTravel to Highmaul and defeat Brackenspore before he gets too powerful to stop.', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Brackenspore' WHERE `ID` = 37766;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Slagworks: Heart of the Mountain', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat the Heart of the Mountain at the Blast Furnace in Blackrock Foundry.', `QuestDescription` = 'Blackrock warriors use weapons forged in cursed fire by the breath of a creature o\' pure flame: The Heart o\' the Mountain. Let\'s disarm \'em, $gboy:lass;! Destroy that infernal creature, and the Blackrock won\'t have enough heat to fuel their Blast Furnace.$b$bTravel to Blackrock Foundry and defeat the Heart o\' the Mountain.', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Heart of the Mountain' WHERE `ID` = 37769;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Black Forge: Kromog', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Kromog in Blackrock Foundry.', `QuestDescription` = 'Yer garrison scouts report that blackrock miners dug up a magnaron, and that the filthy beast has begun helpin\' those brutes churn out their infernal machines. They call it "Kromog."\n\nTravel to Blackrock Foundry and slay that fiend!', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Kromog' WHERE `ID` = 37770;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Iron Assembly: Admiral Gar\'an', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Admiral Gar\'an in Blackrock Foundry.', `QuestDescription` = '"If ye want to topple a wall, start with the foundation." It\'s an old Dwarf saying. If we take out the Iron Horde\'s leadership, the whole thing tumbles.$b$bGar\'an is the Admiral o\' the Iron Horde fleet and first of the so-called "Iron Maidens." She, along with her lieutenants, Marak, and Sorka, have dominated the seas of Draenor.$b$bNo more, $n. Travel to Blackrock Foundry and defeat Admiral Gar\'an.', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Admiral Gar\'an' WHERE `ID` = 37771;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Death to Amethon!', `LogDescription` = 'Retrieve a Humming Draenite Spike from Amethon above Kuuro\'s Claim in Talador.', `QuestDescription` = 'Foreman Eksos down in your Talador outpost figures he has the answer for why there\'s been so much seismic activity recently.$B$BSee, there\'s this giant, ah... earth fury, I think they\'re called, and it\'s covered in these powerful crystals in a cave up above Kuuro\'s Claim. The crystals hum real loud and we think it\'s driving the fury crazy!$B$BProblem is, nobody\'s got the firepower to take the thing down so we can examine a sample. Think you could lend us a hand, commander?', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Amethon' WHERE `ID` = 37773;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tip the Scales' WHERE `ID` = 37779;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure Contract: Gutrek\'s Cleaver', `LogDescription` = 'Search the ogres in the Broken Precipice for clues regarding Goldspade\'s discovery.', `QuestDescription` = 'In Nagrand, the ogres tell of an ancient weapon called Gutrek\'s cleaver. I would very much like to study it.\n\nA goblin treasure hunter by the name of Val Goldspade discovered the whereabouts of the weapon. Unfortunately, this goblin has gone missing somewhere in the Broken Precipice - probably after a run-in with the locals.' WHERE `ID` = 37788;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Auchindoun', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Teron\'gor in Auchindoun.', `QuestDescription` = 'Commander, Gul\'dan\'s favored agent Teron\'gor has infiltrated Auchindoun in Talador and has already taken to devourin\' the countless souls within. We mustn\'t let this nefarious warlock gain any further strength.$B$BEnter the holy mausoleum o\' Auchindoun and rout Teron\'gor and the rest o\' the Shadow Council before more damage is done.', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Teron\'gor' WHERE `ID` = 37796;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest: Start the Garrison Campaign' WHERE `ID` = 37800;
