UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Aegira' WHERE `ID` = 41739;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tech It Up A Notch', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Journeyman Goldmine at the Heart of Azeroth in the Maelstrom.', `QuestDescription` = 'There are many ways to commune with the elements. In their ingenuity, the goblins have found ways to imbue their mechanical devices with the energy of elemental spirits. I do not pretend to understand. But in our hour of need, we should not hesitate to embrace a diversity of options.$b$bWe are fortunate to have at our disposal the services of the one they call "Goldmine," whose unorthodox research may significantly augment our power. He waits nearby.' WHERE `ID` = 41740;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Troops in the Field', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Scouting Map and complete the mission, "Troops in the Field."', `QuestDescription` = 'It is time for us to test the strength of your newly summoned Lesser Elementals. Look at the Scouting Map and send your champions and troops on a routine scouting mission.' WHERE `ID` = 41741;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Celestos' WHERE `ID` = 41742;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Nobundo' WHERE `ID` = 41743;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Rehgar Earthfury' WHERE `ID` = 41744;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Scaldius' WHERE `ID` = 41745;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Muln Earthfury' WHERE `ID` = 41746;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Avalanchion' WHERE `ID` = 41747;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Ritssyn Flamescowl' WHERE `ID` = 41748;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Given to Corruption', `LogDescription` = 'Slay Keeper Varethos.', `QuestDescription` = 'A final favor for an old friend, perhaps? My age-old companion, Varethos, has fallen to the nightmare\'s torment. We once worked in unison to protect this land. His close ties to the land brought him low in this dark hour.$b$bAs with all who suffer this fate, there is no restoring him.$b$bPlease, $n, bring him peace.' WHERE `ID` = 41749;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Calydus' WHERE `ID` = 41750;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Kira Iresoul' WHERE `ID` = 41751;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Zinnin Smythe' WHERE `ID` = 41752;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Jubeka Shadowbreaker' WHERE `ID` = 41753;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Shinfel Blightsworn' WHERE `ID` = 41754;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Lulubelle Fizzlebang' WHERE `ID` = 41755;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Eredar Twins' WHERE `ID` = 41756;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'An Unlikely Ally', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Kira Iresoul in Azsuna.', `QuestDescription` = 'Channeling the demonic gateway will require the assistance of someone with intimate knowledge of the Burning Legion.\n\nI know of such a warlock, though I imagine her blood still boils upon hearing my name. It might be best if you are the one to request her help.' WHERE `ID` = 41759;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Kel\'danath\'s Legacy', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Spellstone of Kel\'danath to charm 5 withered and send them to Shal\'Aran.', `QuestDescription` = 'Kel\'danath discovered something incredible - the power to subdue and even control the withered.\n\nI will pick up where my old friend left off. We shall see to it that he did not die in vain. \n\nPerhaps in the end we can even find peace for the wretches who have been left to a fate worse than death.\n\nI will need more subjects. Take Kel\'danath\'s spellstone and use it to subdue more withered.' WHERE `ID` = 41760;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Winter Moose Roundup', `LogDescription` = 'Rescue 4 Talbuk at Kuuros Farm.', `QuestDescription` = 'My father, Karmaan, owns this farm, and our main livestock are talbuk. One of the podlings must have opened the gate to their pen and they all escaped!$B$BThe little terrors could have slaughtered them in the cage, but they like to hunt their prey. I\'m afraid that if I stay out here much longer, I\'ll be their next meal!$B$BWill you round up the talbuk and bring them here? I can\'t get them myself, and I can\'t let my dad find out about this!' WHERE `ID` = 41761;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Sympathizers Among the Shal\'dorei', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Silgryn in the Suramar Outskirts.', `QuestDescription` = 'Elisande\'s decision to welcome the Legion into Suramar earned her plenty of enemies, though only some of us were bold enough to openly defy her.$B$BWe have allies in the city - we just don\'t know how many.$B$BI need you to make contact with a spell-fencer by the name of Silgryn. He is loyal to our cause, and has been lying in wait since our failed coup.$B$BHe patrols the western edge of the city. Address him by name and tell him our cause is not lost!' WHERE `ID` = 41762;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Close Enough to Touch', `LogDescription` = 'Search for Malfurion within Shala\'nir.', `QuestDescription` = 'He is near, $r, I can feel it.$b$bWe must search Shala\'nir for Malfurion. If we do not find him soon, I fear he will be lost to me forever.$b$bI was unsure of your worth when first we met. I know now that you will not fail me.$b$bI am... grateful.' WHERE `ID` = 41763;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Walking in Their Footsteps', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Water of Vision to walk in the memories of Igrul the Scalebane.', `QuestDescription` = 'Spiritwalkers maintain balance between the world of the living and the spirit realm. We can travel into the memories of the dead to glean clues about the past.\n\nThe wards Ebonhorn maintained were placed long ago by heroes who fought the darkness. By walking in their footsteps, we may locate the wards and restore them.\n\nIgrul, the drogbar known as the Scalebane, was a true friend to Huln Highmountain. Use the Water of Vision to enter his memories and find where he placed the first ward.' WHERE `ID` = 41764;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Wildlife Protection Force', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Rocko in a pet battle.' WHERE `ID` = 41766;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Daring Rescue', `LogDescription` = 'Enter the demon world and rescue the missing council members.', `QuestDescription` = 'The plan is a simple one, but it will require great effort on your part.\n\nKira and I will summon the demonic gateway, but you will have to enter alone and recover the missing council members.' WHERE `ID` = 41767;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Soul Beacon', `LogDescription` = 'Perform a ritual of summoning to retrieve the missing council member.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have bound Shinfel\'s soul to her staff, allowing it to serve as an anchor in this world.\n\nWhen we perform the ritual of summoning, it will act as a beacon, guiding Shinfel through the Twisting Nether and back to our world.' WHERE `ID` = 41768;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Mad Ernie the Alchemist', `LogDescription` = 'Find Mad Ernie the Alchemist in Val\'sharah.', `QuestDescription` = 'If we have any hope of curing this curse, we need to know what kind of magic we\'re dealing with.\n\nI know of an alchemist who earned himself quite the reputation for his unconventional methods. Shunned from Gilneas long ago, I believe Mad Ernie has taken up residence in these lands.\n\nHis knowledge may be the first step to breaking this curse.' WHERE `ID` = 41769;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Skies Above', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Celestos in The Vortex Pinnacle.', `QuestDescription` = 'There has been no Windlord to lead the air elementals since the death of Al\'Akir.$b$bThe realm of Skywall has been thrown into turmoil. The throne of Al\'Akir is Thunderaan\'s by right, but what remains of the prince\'s essence within Thunderfury is diminishing. If we do not move quickly, Thunderaan may be lost forever.$b$bTake the damaged Thunderfury to Vortex Pinnacle and speak with Celestos.$b$bCelestos was a loyal servant of Al\'Akir and he will share our desire to see Thunderaan reborn.' WHERE `ID` = 41770;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Recharging the Blade', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain the Heart of Skywall.', `QuestDescription` = 'You have recovered the Blessed Blade of the Windseeker, and with it you hold all that is left of the soul of Prince Thunderaan.$b$bThunderfury can be restored, but it will require a rare essence known as the Heart of Skywall.$b$bVortos, the Duke of the East Winds, possesses the heart... but he will not give it willingly.$b$bVortos must be defeated, and the Heart of Skywall must be combined with the blade.$b$bOnly then can Thunderaan return and claim the Throne of Four Winds.' WHERE `ID` = 41771;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Ascendant of Flames', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Rehgar Earthfury in the Firelands.', `QuestDescription` = 'As we speak, an endless war rages for control of the Firelands. Of the two aspiring Firelords, Lord Smolderon hates mortals less.$b$bIf we help him defeat his rival and ascend to Firelord, he may unite with us in return.$b$bThe champions of the Earthen Ring have already made their way to the Firelands. Go and meet with Rehgar Earthfury and find a way to turn an old enemy into a new ally.$b$bIf anyone can succeed at this impossible task, I have faith that it is you, Farseer.$b$bMay the elements be with you.' WHERE `ID` = 41772;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Firelord\'s Command', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat the forces of Pyroth.', `QuestDescription` = 'Greetings, mortal. I am Scaldius, emissary of Lord Smolderon.$b$bI have just met with others from your order. They tell me that you will bring an end to those who oppose my master. This pleases Lord Smolderon.$b$bPyroth and his minions defy my master\'s rule and so an example must be made of them. You will slay Pyroth and his champions!$b$bNothing is more humiliating than death at the hands of a mortal. Do this and Lord Smolderon will grant you audience.' WHERE `ID` = 41773;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Great Stonemother', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Therazane in Deepholm.', `QuestDescription` = 'In order to unite the four Elemental Lords of Azeroth, you will need to seek out Therazane and convince her to join the cause of Azeroth.$b$bHowever, the Stonemother currently has her hands full battling a Twilight\'s Hammer resurgence in Deepholm.$b$bIf we lend Therazane our aid she may agree to unite with the Earthen Ring against the Burning Legion.$b$bJourney to Therazane\'s Throne in the heart of Deepholm. Aid her in defeating the Twilight\'s Hammer and convince her to join the defense of Azeroth!' WHERE `ID` = 41775;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Return of the Windlord', `LogDescription` = 'Summon Prince Thunderaan.', `QuestDescription` = 'With Thunderfury recharged, Prince Thunderaan can now return to the physical realm.$b$bIn a moment, I will release my master\'s spirit from the blessed blade.$b$bWhen the ritual is complete, Skywall will once again have its Windlord.' WHERE `ID` = 41776;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Destroying the Cult', `LogDescription` = 'Slay 15 Twilight\'s Hammer cultists at The Twilight Throne.', `QuestDescription` = 'We are all that stands between the Twilight\'s Hammer and their conquest of Deepholm.$b$bAzeroth cannot hope to fight the full strength of the Twilight\'s Hammer and the Burning Legion at the same time. It is up to us to put an end to their cult before they are able to fully rebuild.$b$bAccompany me into their stronghold and we shall cut through their ranks together!' WHERE `ID` = 41777;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Firing Up the Forge', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Obliterum Forge to obliterate Archmage Karlain\'s Imbued Silkweave Robes.', `QuestDescription` = 'Are you familiar with the Obliterum Forge? It can be used to destroy crafted gear, yielding valuable Obliterum. I\'m personally quite curious to see it in action.$b$bOne of my many admirers recently gifted me a set of adventuring robes, but I\'m afraid they\'re not quite my style.$b$bPlace them inside the forge and see what happens.' WHERE `ID` = 41778;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Doom and Gloom', `LogDescription` = 'Recover the ingredients Ernest needs to create an Elixir of Suspension.', `QuestDescription` = 'Doom curses are serious business, so much so that many warlocks didn\'t deal in them for some time. \n\nThe magic grows stronger as time goes on, eventually leading to death. Only the caster of the curse can remove it.\n\nI can craft an elixir that will slow its progression, but you\'ll need to collect an assortment of ingredients first.' WHERE `ID` = 41780;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Herding Goats', `LogDescription` = 'Catch Greyhorn Goats, then return them to their pen.', `QuestDescription` = 'In case you haven\'t noticed, things are a bit hectic around here.\n\nMarl\'s doing a good job protecting the corn fields, but the commotion gave our goats quite the scare. They dashed out of their pen as soon as the fighting started, and are now running amuck!\n\nRound them up for me and I\'ll do my best to figure out how to handle the curse you\'re dealing with.' WHERE `ID` = 41781;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'To The Hills', `LogDescription` = 'Fill a Vial of Moonwell Water and locate Lea Stonepaw within Grizzly Hills.', `QuestDescription` = 'It is said that a fragment of Ursoc\'s spirit, his fury and rage, remained within the claws after his death. Only those who have attained mastery of discipline have any hope of wielding them without being overwhelmed by the bear lord\'s fury.$b$b<Lea looks intently at you for a moment.>$b$bBut you are no novice, I can see that clearly.$b$bVery well, draw water from the moonwell on the northern edge of the grove then come find me. I\'ll await your arrival within the broken stump of Vordrassil in Northrend.' WHERE `ID` = 41782;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fallen Offerings', `LogDescription` = 'Search the bodies of Frostpaw Shaman for Offerings to Ursol and return them to Lea Stonepaw within Grizzlemaw', `QuestDescription` = 'When the claws were sealed away, magical wards were placed to prevent anyone from reaching their location. Only the power of a demigod can give us passage through the wards, one such as Ursol, the brother of Ursoc.$b$bUrsol is a reclusive guardian and requires an offering before he will appear to us.$b$blike Ursoc, he was worshipped by the furbolg, but years of war have decimated their tribes and their shaman lay dead.$b$bSearch the bodies of the fallen for their offerings while I prepare the shrine.' WHERE `ID` = 41783;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Borrowed Time', `LogDescription` = 'Give the Elixir of Suspension to Shinfel Blightsworn.', `QuestDescription` = 'Don\'t let the aroma deceive you, this concoction is mostly safe for consumption.\n\nWhoever is afflicted should drink the entire contents of the vial, every last drop! If the elixir works, the effects should be immediate. If not, well... just tell them they drink at their own risk, alright?\n\nKeep in mind, this will only weaken the curse, not cure it.' WHERE `ID` = 41784;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Finding Fizzlebang', `LogDescription` = 'Find Lulubelle Fizzlebang in Stormheim.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have reason to believe that Wilfred Fizzlebang\'s sister has made her way to Stormheim.\n\nIf she has half his power, but at least twice his intelligence, then we just might succeed in summoning the eredar twins.' WHERE `ID` = 41785;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = '7.0 Suramar - Vignette: Sea Giant King - twh' WHERE `ID` = 41786;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Someone Else\'s Mess', `LogDescription` = 'Banish demons that have been irresponsibly summoned in Stormheim.', `QuestDescription` = 'A confession alone won\'t be enough to clear my name. As long as those demons run amuck, people will blame their presence on me. \n\nSomeone needs to clean up the mess that warlock made. I\'d do it myself, but I can\'t be placed at the scene of the crime.\n\nYou could banish them though. That would do the trick. Use this orb on newly summoned demons to send them right back where they came from - permanently!' WHERE `ID` = 41787;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Coercing a Confession', `LogDescription` = 'Find the warlock that has been irresponsibly summoning demons and obtain a written confession of his wrongdoings.', `QuestDescription` = 'My location has to be kept secret, at least until I have proof of my innocence.\n\nThanks to the legacy of my family name, any time some miserable warlock summons demons they can\'t control, I get the blame.\n\nThe scene of my latest "crime" is a nearby cave, where unruly imps and other nasty demons are roaming free.\n\nFind the lousy warlock who\'s responsible, and get him to write a confession.' WHERE `ID` = 41788;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Return to the Crag' WHERE `ID` = 41789;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The First Trial of Ursol', `LogDescription` = 'Complete the first of Ursol\'s trials.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Legion...$b$b<the glow of Ursol\'s eyes begin to shine intensely>$b$bYes... I remember clearly that day long ago when my brother fell. Countless demons fell beneath his claws until, through the overwhelming numbers of the enemy, he was overtaken. My brother was the true spirit of the bear!$b$bYou must prove to me that the spirit of the bear resides within you as well.' WHERE `ID` = 41790;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Second Trial of Ursol', `LogDescription` = 'Complete the second of Ursol\'s trials.', `QuestDescription` = 'Ursoc never backed down from a battle, even when faced with overwhelming odds. If you would take up his claws you will show me that you possess the same courage.$b$bYour next trial will place you against an onslaught of my followers. Defeat all of the spirits and prove that you possess the courage of the bear!' WHERE `ID` = 41791;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Third Trial of Ursol', `LogDescription` = 'Complete the third of Ursol\'s trials.', `QuestDescription` = 'You\'ve proven to me your strength and your courage, but do you possess the ability to apply yourself when it matters most?$b$bThis final trial will reveal all.' WHERE `ID` = 41792;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Lulubelle on Loan', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Ritssyn Flamescowl.', `QuestDescription` = 'What you plan to do is pretty risky, you know? Summoning one sister would be difficult enough, but both of them at once? That\'s just asking for trouble.\n\nLuckily, I\'m up for the challenge. I\'ll help you and the rest of the council summon those demons, and hopefully restore pride to the Fizzlebang name.' WHERE `ID` = 41793;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Drakestalker' WHERE `ID` = 41794;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Summoning the Sisters', `LogDescription` = 'Travel through the Demonic Gateway to reach the summoning platform and use the Bloodstone to subdue the eredar sisters once the summoning is complete.', `QuestDescription` = 'It would be best to conduct the summoning on the outskirts of Dreadscar Rift. If things do not go as planned, at least the aftermath will be contained to a small island of land that floats above our order.$B$BOnce the sisters have been summoned, use the Bloodstone to enslave them.$B$BI\'ll let the others know it\'s time to begin.' WHERE `ID` = 41795;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Selecting a Sixth', `LogDescription` = 'Choose who will become the final member of the council.', `QuestDescription` = 'With the demon sisters under your control, you have managed to weaken Mephistroth\'s army and gain powerful allies for the council.\n\nOur work is not done, however. Dreadscar Rift will remain a target as long as the Burning Legion remains.\n\nIf we wish to protect our new home, we must rebuild the council. Both Lulubelle and Kira have proven themselves worthy to join our ranks, though only one spot remains.\n\nAs First of the Black Harvest, the choice is yours.' WHERE `ID` = 41796;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Recruiting The Troops', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Imp Mother Dyala and train a Pack of Imps.', `QuestDescription` = 'As her name suggests, Imp Mother Dyala is adept at summoning imps.\n\nWhile the council controls Dreadscar Rift, her services will be ours to use as we see fit.\n\nSpeak to her if you wish to train a pack of imps.' WHERE `ID` = 41797;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Recruiting More Troops', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Recruiter Jared.', `QuestDescription` = 'As First of the council, you have acolytes devoted to helping any way they can. Recruiter Jared is in charge of screening candidates, only selecting those that possess the skills we desire.$B$BSpeak to him now.' WHERE `ID` = 41798;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Minions of the Darkness', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Water of Vision to walk in the memories of Oenia Skyhorn.', `QuestDescription` = 'Oenia Skyhorn was a legendary chieftain of her tribe. Though she crossed over to the spirit realm long ago, her presence is still felt all around us.\n\nEbonhorn told me that Oenia placed a ward here to protect the people she cared for so deeply... perhaps from the specter of the Darkness.\n\nUse the Water of Vision to journey into her echoes. Worry not that this ritual might disturb her rest. A hero like Oenia would relish a chance to aid us in the present.' WHERE `ID` = 41799;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Servants of the Darkness', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Water of Vision to walk in the memories of Huln Highmountain.', `QuestDescription` = 'The heroes of Highmountain\'s past placed wards to protect our land from the insidious Old Gods. The deeds of these noble champions kept us safe for thousands of years.\n\nWe must not fail their memory.\n\nHuln Highmountain himself placed the ward here at Snowblind Mesa. It must be reactivated for us to have any hope of saving Ebonhorn.\n\nEnter the echo of Huln\'s spirit, and let his courage lead you to the location of this ward.' WHERE `ID` = 41800;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Gates of Valor', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain $1oa Chipped Titan Disc Fragments by surveying near the Gates of Valor in Stormheim.', `QuestDescription` = 'Ye\'d not normally know it, but the terraced entrance to the vrykul\'s Halls o\' Valor is a fine place for findin\' ancient artifacts. Problem is, the place is just a big mess with demons at the time.$b$bWell, ye\'ve not got much choice. If the disc isn\'t elsewhere in Stormheim, it most likely lies at the Gates of Valor. Good luck, $n.' WHERE `ID` = 41802;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Asking a Favor', `LogDescription` = 'Ask Khadgar for a source to power the Legion communicator.', `QuestDescription` = 'Caria Felsoul was a bright student... and a Legion traitor.$B$BIn her treason she was bestowed the Aldrachi Warblades, the soul-rending blades of the Aldrachi\'s greatest champion - they say he only finally fell to Sargeras himself.$B$BWe sent a small force to find Caria, but we have not heard word since. Jace has a Legion communicator he believes we can use to reach them- we just need a power source.$B$BPerhaps you could see if Khadgar has anything we could use? I\'m afraid our allies are few.' WHERE `ID` = 41803;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Ask and You Shall Receive', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain the Crystallized Soul from Archmage Khadgar.', `QuestDescription` = 'A Legion communicator? Hmmmm.$B$B<Khadgar pauses to think for a moment.>$B$BYou know what, I think I have something in my lockbox upstairs that is just the ticket.' WHERE `ID` = 41804;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Key of Kalyndras' WHERE `ID` = 41805;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Return to Jace', `LogDescription` = 'Return to Jace Darkweaver.', `QuestDescription` = 'That crystallized soul should power your communicator long enough to reach your allies.$B$BI must urge you to be cautious, $n. If that device is of Legion origin, then you never know who among its creators might overhear your message.$B$BI\'m sure your allies eagerly await your return.' WHERE `ID` = 41806;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Establishing a Connection', `LogDescription` = 'Activate the Legion Communicator and receive Allari the Souleater\'s report.', `QuestDescription` = '<Jace glances at the crystallized soul.>$B$BYes, that will do nicely. Release its energy to activate the communicator - it should already be configured to contact Allari and her forces.$B$BIf Caria is out there, we will find her, and we will make her suffer for her transgressions.' WHERE `ID` = 41807;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest: Saw Boss Cinematic' WHERE `ID` = 41812;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Curse of the Necrodark', `LogDescription` = 'Journey to Highmountain Summit.', `QuestDescription` = 'It is clear that the Old Gods have long sought to control Highmountain. Their covetous desire speaks to the power of this land, and the strength of the spirits that echo through its peaks and valleys.\n\nThey will not take our sacred mountain, $n. Not while I draw breath.\n\nWith the Highmountain tribes united, and with Baine Bloodhoof at our side, we will defeat the Darkness... once and for all.\n\nCome. Let us take back the summit from the forces that would corrupt it.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Rendezvous with Baine Bloodhoof at Highmountain Summit.' WHERE `ID` = 41815;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Oubdob da Smasher' WHERE `ID` = 41816;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Skull of the Taskmaster' WHERE `ID` = 41817;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Majestic Elderhorn' WHERE `ID` = 41818;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Gurbog da Basher' WHERE `ID` = 41819;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Shara Felbreath' WHERE `ID` = 41821;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Following his Hoofsteps' WHERE `ID` = 41822;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Arru' WHERE `ID` = 41824;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Crawshuk the Hungry' WHERE `ID` = 41826;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Bristlemaul' WHERE `ID` = 41828;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Demon\'s Bite' WHERE `ID` = 41830;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Taurson\'s Punch Out' WHERE `ID` = 41831;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'White Water Terror' WHERE `ID` = 41832;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Grmlrml\'s Last Ride' WHERE `ID` = 41833;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Masks We Wear', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with $3oa Masqued Revelers while in costume, then speak with Ly\'leth Lunastre.', `QuestDescription` = 'Many nightborne had pinned their hopes on Thalyssra deposing the Grand Magistrix. Since she disappeared, dissenting voices have grown silent.\n\nWe must spread the word, discreetly, among the populace. Ly\'leth Lunastre will be a perfect ally in this. She is a socialite with many connections, and she is no friend of the Legion.\n\nLy\'leth hosts a masquerade party at her estate where rumors are traded like coin - and brandished like daggers.\n\nLet us invite ourselves in.' WHERE `ID` = 41834;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Deworming' WHERE `ID` = 41835;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Bodash the Hoarder' WHERE `ID` = 41836;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Rockaway Bully' WHERE `ID` = 41837;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Slumber' WHERE `ID` = 41838;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Ice and Shadow', `LogDescription` = 'Collect $1oa Shadowice Shards.', `QuestDescription` = 'We took down one of the Necrodark. Ebonhorn found that it held a shard of ice infused with shadow essence.\n\nPerhaps the villains are using these shards as a kind of talisman. I suggest you deprive them of their trinkets.\n\nI know little of such magics, but it seemed that Ebonhorn had a use for them in mind.' WHERE `ID` = 41840;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Final Ward', `LogDescription` = 'Restore the Summit Ward.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Necrodark are readying their ritual to give physical form to the Darkness. They\'ve sealed themselves inside and barred our way.\n\nThe shards you brought me should provide the means to bring down the barrier. Once it is done, we have to act quickly. We must restore the final ward before the Darkness can manifest.\n\nDo not hesitate. The fate of Highmountain itself hangs in the balance.' WHERE `ID` = 41841;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Bottom of the Food Chain' WHERE `ID` = 41842;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Sekhan' WHERE `ID` = 41844;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Iron Fist', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Angus Ironfist at Tideskorn Warcamp in Stormheim.', `QuestDescription` = 'It\'s time to send a rescue operation to the Gates of Valor, $n.$B$BI will prepare our troops and send them at once. We will need a sizable army to take on the massive Legion force in Stormheim.$B$BGrandmaster, go ahead whenever you are ready. I will send our forces to meet you in the field.' WHERE `ID` = 41849;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Master of Swords', `LogDescription` = 'Collect Dravax\'s Key from Dravax, then free Sylara Shadowheart.', `QuestDescription` = 'I got bad news fer ya - we don\'t have time to wait for reinforcements. They\'re sacrificin\' prisoners now! Every minute we wait here jabberin\' is another life on the line!$B$BFirst things first, my friend Sylara is being held captive in the camp just across the road.$B$BWe need ta free her - she\'ll be a valuable ally.$B$BWe\'ve got ta move move move!' WHERE `ID` = 41850;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Quelling the Tide', `LogDescription` = 'Kill 16 Legion defenders at the Gate of Valor.', `QuestDescription` = '<Sylara looks at you with determined eyes.>$B$BOur friends are in danger. We will save them. Kill any Legion in the way.' WHERE `ID` = 41851;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'No Monk Left Behind', `LogDescription` = 'Free 6 Tortured Prisoners.', `QuestDescription` = 'Most of the prisoners are being held in the main camp at the Gates of Valor.$B$BOur people have been beaten and tortured, and worse still awaits for them if we don\'t save them.$B$BFind the cages within the main camp and free as many monks as you can find.$B$BI\'ll be right beside you, knocking heads and taking names!' WHERE `ID` = 41852;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Zero to Hiro', `LogDescription` = 'Steal a Storm Brew, then save Hiro.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have a favor to ask of you, $n. My good friend Hiro is still somewhere inside the main camp.$B$BOnly problem is, the Gates of Valor are swarming with the biggest, baddest, nastiest Legion creatures I\'ve ever seen. If we walk in there, we\'ll just get slaughtered.$B$BBut I\'ve seen these vrykul chugging some kind of special brew called Storm Brew. It\'s some kind of combat tonic that makes them bigger and stronger.$B$BLet\'s steal some of that drink, then storm in to save Hiro!' WHERE `ID` = 41853;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Brick By Brick', `LogDescription` = 'Return to Iron-Body Ponshu on the Wandering Isle.', `QuestDescription` = 'Da monks be free, and we put a thorn in dat eredar lady\'s side.$B$BI\'m back wit my friends, and lookin\' forward to sleepin\' in a bed tonight.$B$BLet\'s go back ta da Wanderin\' Isle. I\'ve never been so excited ta see a turtle in my life.' WHERE `ID` = 41854;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Stand Up to Bullies' WHERE `ID` = 41855;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Legion Portal' WHERE `ID` = 41856;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Neltharion\'s Lair: Stonedark Slaves' WHERE `ID` = 41857;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Dealing with Satyrs' WHERE `ID` = 41860;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Meet The Maw' WHERE `ID` = 41861;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Only Pets Can Prevent Forest Fires' WHERE `ID` = 41862;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vengeance Will Be Ours', `LogDescription` = 'Take the Aldrachi Warblades from Caria Felsoul.', `QuestDescription` = 'Caria lies in the very heart of Legion territory - they\'ll see our forces immediately if we try to launch an all-out attack.$B$BFailure is not an option.$B$BHowever, if you go alone you might be able to slip by unnoticed long enough to avoid the brunt of the Legion army.$B$BRemember, $n - this is not a rescue mission. The power of the Aldrachi Warblades could tip the scales of this war in our favor; Allari and her men are expendable if need be.' WHERE `ID` = 41863;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Neltharion\'s Lair: Crystalline Crusher' WHERE `ID` = 41864;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Neltharion\'s Lair: Mother of Stone' WHERE `ID` = 41865;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Neltharion\'s Lair: Blighted Bat' WHERE `ID` = 41866;
