UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Perfect Opportunity', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Ly\'leth Lunastre at the Waning Crescent.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have heard whispers from Suramar City.\n\nRecent unrest in the city has prompted the nobles to seek another advisor to fill Elisande\'s council. Such positions are rarely offered and hotly contested.\n\nThis is the perfect opportunity and Ly\'leth is the perfect candidate. Fate smiles upon our cause!\n\nI know she has historically chosen to avoid such politics and maneuvering, but we must now ask her to join the fray.\n\nSeek her out at the Waning Crescent and ensure her victory.' WHERE `ID` = 43309;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Either With Us', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Lady Aurore.', `QuestDescription` = 'Thalyssra asks much of me, but our cause is worth the risks.\n\nThe title of advisor would grant us enormous influence. Information. Access.\n\nI could change this rebellion. I could save so many lives.\n\nI will need strong endorsement to ascend, though. There are many houses who stand with me by virtue of my family\'s name. Some are more hesitant.\n\nLady Aurore of House Astravar is the most prominent of these. Seek her out. Offer your aid in my stead. \n\nEarn her trust and the rest will follow.' WHERE `ID` = 43310;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Or Against Us', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Arluin.', `QuestDescription` = 'If Ly\'leth is to achieve the role of advisor to the Grand Magistrix we will need to open a path for her.\n\nIt is true she will have some supporters but they alone cannot grant her the title.\n\nThere are other houses that Ly\'leth must contend with. Fear and coercion are their tools. None dare stand against them openly, and we cannot win them over with favors and oaths. \n\nSeek out Arluin. I trust he will have some ideas of how to proceed.' WHERE `ID` = 43311;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Thinly Veiled Threats', `LogDescription` = 'Rescue Ailen Astravar.', `QuestDescription` = 'How could I let this happen?\n\n<Aurore wrings her hands.>\n\nYesterday Coryn Stelleris approached me about the appointment. He sought my support, but I did not offer it. \n\nHe said my son\'s life would continue as normal... if I gave him my vote.\n\nThis morning my son was gone.\n\nI can only think of the terrible things he may be suffering. You know what this family is capable of!\n\nYou want my support, but I can do nothing while my son is in danger. Nothing.\n\nPlease... save him!' WHERE `ID` = 43312;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Rumor Has It', `LogDescription` = 'Plant rumors among members of House Duskmere.', `QuestDescription` = 'Coryn Stelleris and Ruven Duskmere were close friends, but one always overshadowed the other. Now the Stelleris family stands to gain from lord Ruven\'s death. Handsomely.\n\nHouse Duskmere will soon learn of their loss. I want you to be the one to redirect their anger and grief.\n\nA handful of well placed rumors should do the trick.\n\nI won\'t be lingering in this part of the city for long, and Ly\'leth will want to know of your efforts.\n\nReturn to her when you are finished.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Return to Ly\'leth at the Waning Crescent.' WHERE `ID` = 43313;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Court of Stars: Beware the Fury of a Patient Elf', `LogDescription` = 'Enter the Court of Stars dungeon and slay Advisor Melandrus. Collect his Spellstone and return it to Thalyssra.', `QuestDescription` = 'An opportunity presents itself, $n.\n\nLy\'leth has arranged to grant you entry into a ball at the Court of Stars. I do not know what we may gain from this venture, but there is one task I must set for you.\n\nAdvisor Melandrus once called himself my ally. He and I planned Elisande\'s downfall, but when the moment came I found myself betrayed.\n\nThe wound his dagger inflicted still aches. I cannot enter Suramar to take my revenge, but you can.\n\nGive him a traitor\'s death, and bring me his spellstone.' WHERE `ID` = 43314;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Death Becomes Him', `LogDescription` = 'Slay Ruven Duskmere.', `QuestDescription` = 'There are two houses that pose a threat to Ly\'leth\'s rise, but we concern ourselves with only one of them now.\n\nHouse Duskmere commands respect through fear and that fear is not unfounded. Few can boast of magical talent equal to that of Ruven Duskmere. \n\nWithout this charming specimen, however, their house is nothing.\n\nI know you may find my methods distasteful. Know that there were demons in Suramar long before the Legion.\n\nThis one has lived long enough.' WHERE `ID` = 43315;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'By Invitation Only' WHERE `ID` = 43316;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'In the Bag', `LogDescription` = 'Witness Ly\'leth Lunastre\'s ascension to advisor.', `QuestDescription` = 'Already the city is abuzz with outrage.\n\nI will not lie to you- it pleases me greatly that one such as Coryn is made a fool.\n\nThe other houses have sent their endorsements. It is done, and nothing remains but a formal ceremony to grant me the title of advisor.\n\nMeet me there. You deserve to share in this success.' WHERE `ID` = 43317;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Ly\'leth\'s Champion', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Ly\'leth to begin the encounter.', `QuestDescription` = 'Tal\'ashar is an honor duel.\n\nIf I lose, then I must forfeit my title to Coryn Stelleris.\n\n<Ly\'leth smiles gently.>\n\nThat is why you are going to fight for me. \n\nI will grant you a more powerful disguise for this task, and together we will put Coryn in his place.\n\nSpeak to me when you are ready to battle on my behalf.' WHERE `ID` = 43318;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Way of the Tiger', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Recruiter Gin Lai.', `QuestDescription` = 'Among the allies who joined us from Tian Monastery is Gin Lai, a monk famed for his experience in the ways of the tiger.$B$BWith his help, we will be able to train Tiger Initiates, who strike swiftly and precisely on the field of battle.$B$BGo speak with him now and request his services.' WHERE `ID` = 43319;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Time to Reflect', `LogDescription` = 'Correctly answer one of Llore\'s questions about the history of Azeroth.', `QuestDescription` = 'It is time to reflect on the events that have brought us to this moment. A celebration of our great history and the events that shape it.' WHERE `ID` = 43323;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Rage of the Owlbeasts' WHERE `ID` = 43324;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Ley Race' WHERE `ID` = 43325;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Magic of Flight' WHERE `ID` = 43327;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Enigmatic' WHERE `ID` = 43328;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Time to Collect', `LogDescription` = 'Collect Sixtrigger\'s Key from Rax Sixtrigger in Stormheim.', `QuestDescription` = 'Hey there, pal. My sources around here say you had a run-in with the Sixtrigger brothers. I\'d imagine you\'re not very happy with them?\n\nLet\'s just say we\'re not exactly friends either.\n\nSo I\'ll tell you what. How about I let you in on some intel about their current location? Maybe they might have an unfortunate accident, you follow?\n\nOh, and bring some friends. They\'re not exactly the easiest of targets.' WHERE `ID` = 43331;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Grell in a Handbasket' WHERE `ID` = 43332;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Nylaathria the Forgotten' WHERE `ID` = 43333;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Coming Storm', `LogDescription` = 'Travel to Pandaria and speak to the White Tiger at his temple.', `QuestDescription` = 'You saved us all, my friend! Truly you embody all the elements stand for.$b$bIf the Earthen Ring is to prevail, we will need weapons of great power. I know where to find some. After the Pandaren Campaign, the weapons of the storm god Ra-den were discovered beneath the Throne of Thunder. None have been able to wield them, so great is their power.$b$bThey were placed in the care of the White Tiger, who will give them only to one who is worthy. Come $n! Travel with me to Pandaria and we will prove your worth!' WHERE `ID` = 43334;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Survival Skills', `LogDescription` = 'Show your survival skill by building a campfire from chopped wood, and cooking a steak over an open flame.', `QuestDescription` = 'The life of a hunter should never be dull. Living in the wild you never know what will happen next, but you survive on skill and instinct.$B$BShow me you have the basic survival skills to live off the land.' WHERE `ID` = 43335;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Purge of the Nightmare' WHERE `ID` = 43336;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Met Sylvanas With Windrunner Bow' WHERE `ID` = 43337;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Codex of Ra', `LogDescription` = 'Enter the Guo Lai Halls in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms and collect the Edict of Stone, the Edict of Fire, and the Edict of the Storm. Cleanse the area by slaying mogu spirits.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Thunder King conquered Pandaria using power stolen from the Titan Keeper Ra, known as "Ra-den" in the mogu tongue. If you truly seek to wield the relics of the Highkeeper, seek out his ancient edicts among the ruins in the heart of the mogu empire: The Edict of Stone, The Edict of Fire, and the Edict of the Storm.$b$bThese pieces of the codex are scattered amongst the Guo-Lai Halls in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, one in each wing.' WHERE `ID` = 43338;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 43340;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Uniting the Isles', `LogDescription` = 'Earn at least Friendly reputation with the factions of the Broken Isles.', `QuestDescription` = 'There are a great number of factions here on the Broken Isles. We must unite them if we want to stand a chance against the Legion. Prove your worth to them and report back to me.', `PortraitGiverText` = 'We need your help!', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Archmage Khadgar' WHERE `ID` = 43341;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vignette - Roteye' WHERE `ID` = 43342;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vignette: Dread-Rider Cortis' WHERE `ID` = 43343;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Aodh Witherpetal' WHERE `ID` = 43344;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Harbinger of Screams' WHERE `ID` = 43345;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Ealdis' WHERE `ID` = 43346;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Rabxach' WHERE `ID` = 43347;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vignette: Magister Phaedris' WHERE `ID` = 43348;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Aegis of Aggramar', `LogDescription` = 'Secure the Aegis of Aggramar in the Chamber of the Guardian in Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = 'Now that it\'s out of the hands of the Legion, the Aegis should be brought back to Dalaran for safekeeping while the hunt continues for the rest of the Pillars of Creation.\n\nIt should be safe in the central portal chamber until the time comes when it is needed.' WHERE `ID` = 43349;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Mal\'Dreth the Corrupter' WHERE `ID` = 43351;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Asset Security', `LogDescription` = 'Defend Arluin\'s stash from the city guards.', `QuestDescription` = 'With the demons and guards so agitated, I\'m running out of safe places to store contraband. The guards have caught on to one of my favorite havens and will be making off with my goods any minute now.\n\nHead to my stash and discourage their curiosity. You will need to use a grappling hook to access it- just look for something to latch onto along the ledge.\n\nI will make sure there is something in it for you when you are done.' WHERE `ID` = 43352;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest: Celestine of the Harvest' WHERE `ID` = 43353;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest: Thisalee Crow' WHERE `ID` = 43354;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest: Matoclaw' WHERE `ID` = 43355;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest: Talza' WHERE `ID` = 43356;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest: Graham Silverclaw' WHERE `ID` = 43357;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vignette: Myonix' WHERE `ID` = 43358;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Forge of the Roaring Mountain and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = 'Grand Master, you have saved our order from the brink of destruction.$b$bYour deeds have shown us that with effort and determination we can overcome any challenge. In light of your example, we have doubled our efforts and developed a technique that will awaken your weapon to its true potential.$b$bPlease, stand before the Forge of the Roaring Mountain and raise your weapon high.' WHERE `ID` = 43359;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Shardmaidens', `LogDescription` = 'Slay 6 Shardmaidens in the Shattered Locus.', `QuestDescription` = 'Long have I walked this land and I have seen many forms of corruption.\n\nThe creatures that wander this hall are twisted by the magics unleashed by the failed arcan\'dor. These dryads have lost their way, and cannot be saved.\n\nYou must destroy them. End their suffering.' WHERE `ID` = 43360;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fragments of Disaster', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 5 Crystallized Bark.', `QuestDescription` = 'In the hall beyond rests the bones of the failed arcan\'dor.\n\nI will take fragments of the crystallized tree and attempt to read them. We must discover the root cause of this destruction.\n\nOnly then do we have any hope of preventing this disaster from repeating itself.' WHERE `ID` = 43361;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Emerald Nightmare: The Stuff of Dreams', `LogDescription` = 'Collect Purified Life Essence from the Emerald Dream, hidden inside the Emerald Nightmare Raid.', `QuestDescription` = 'This arcan\'dor is one of an ancient species. They were not bred, but created. In them the arcane and primitive druidic magics merged into something greater than both.\n\nThe arcane will soon devour it whole.\n\nWe can restore balance, but it will require wild magic. Magic trapped in another realm.\n\nYou must enter the Emerald Dream- the pure, unsullied vision of Azeroth - and bring back the essence of life itself.\n\nOnly then can the arcan\'dor find stability and begin to thrive once more.' WHERE `ID` = 43362;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Winter Veil Gift' WHERE `ID` = 43363;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Gently Shaken Gift' WHERE `ID` = 43364;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Cycle Continues', `LogDescription` = 'Plant 100 Dream Seeds on corpses.', `QuestDescription` = 'Yay! The grove is regenerating nicely. Our flower friends thank you for helping them.$B$BWe were able to save most of the grove, but sadly, many living souls were lost as well.$B$BBrightwing is so sad!$B$BBut you can help! Take this bag of Dream Seeds. Plant them onto fresh corpses, and in time, new flowers will grow!$B$BDeath is beautiful, and from death comes rebirth. This is the cycle that must continue!' WHERE `ID` = 43365;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Talked with Mimiron' WHERE `ID` = 43366;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Pixie Dust' WHERE `ID` = 43367;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Brightwing' WHERE `ID` = 43368;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vignette: Siegemaster Aedrin' WHERE `ID` = 43369;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A New Invention', `LogDescription` = 'I should be able to create an item that allows you to change the appearance of Hati, but the components for such an item are rare. The Squallhunters from Stormheim have a Stormy Gland, and the Stoneblood Harpies near Thas\'talah in Val\'sharah have Pristine Harpy Feathers that I need.  The Hatecoil Naga near the Ruins of Nar\'thalas in Azsuna are said to have Reflective Scales, and finally I need an Essence of Pure Spirit from the Seabound Mystics in the Blind Marshlands of Highmountain.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have been experimenting with technology that allows you to alter the structure of beasts, specifically with how they look.' WHERE `ID` = 43370;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Relieving the Front Lines', `LogDescription` = 'Interact with the Command Map and complete the mission, "Relieving the Front Lines".', `QuestDescription` = 'Many within our order have been on the front lines of battle for too long, aiding those who are attempting to thwart the Legion\'s invasion.$B$BIt is time we send in some relief, allowing our allies some much needed rest.' WHERE `ID` = 43371;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Whispers in the Void', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Gilner Greymoss in the Sanctuary of the Void.', `QuestDescription` = 'Our priests are resting and recuperating, but one not as well as the others. Gilner Greymoss lingers within the Sanctuary of the Void, laughing to himself.$B$BHe refuses to leave, but his presence is making the other priests uneasy.$B$BPerhaps you should speak to him and see what is wrong?' WHERE `ID` = 43372;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Best and Brightest', `LogDescription` = 'Find Zabra Hexx in Azsuna.', `QuestDescription` = 'If we wish to see the truth in Gilner\'s ramblings, I will need to induce a vision.$B$BIt is not the sort of thing that is typically forced, but we have within our ranks the best and brightest alchemists who can craft an extract that will grant me the sight I need.$B$BSeek them out in Azsuna where they are currently aiding those on the front lines.' WHERE `ID` = 43373;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Murloc Mind Control', `LogDescription` = 'Rescue Yalia Sagewhisper from the murlocs within El\'dranil Shallows.', `QuestDescription` = 'Yalia and I were deliverin\' antidotes to da front lines a Faronaar when we were attacked by a herd a murlocs. We dropped our supplies and made a run for it, but Yalia never made it out a da camp. Obviously I didn\'t fair much better, ma bones still ache from bein\' turned to stone.$B$BIt\'s possible Yalia\'s still alive and bein\' held captive. Please, ya have to find her!' WHERE `ID` = 43374;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'An Ample Supply', `LogDescription` = 'Recover Felbat Toxin Salve from supply crates scattered around El\'dranil Shallows.', `QuestDescription` = 'Durin\' our attempt to flee da murlocs, Yalia and I dropped da supplies we planned to deliver to da demon hunters in Faronaar.$B$BInside each a those crates were vials a salve dat took us countless days and resources to craft. If we don\' get those supplies back, I fear our allies on da front lines will suffer.' WHERE `ID` = 43375;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Problem Salver', `LogDescription` = 'Use the salve on diseased demon hunters at Faronaar Front in Azsuna.', `QuestDescription` = 'Forcing a vision isn\'t easy by any means. Finding the ingredients for the elixir alone will take a considerable amount of time, time we don\'t have. Too many are suffering on the front lines as we speak, in need of the salve we were meant to deliver.$B$BI suppose if we all work together, we can make this work.$B$BZabra and I will find the items needed for Velen\'s elixir, if you take the salve to Faronaar and cure the demon hunters. Does that sound fair?' WHERE `ID` = 43376;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Halls of Valor: The Light Within', `LogDescription` = 'Recover a Spark of Light from Hyrja within the Halls of Valor dungeon.', `QuestDescription` = 'We cannot ignore the Prophet\'s vision, $n. To do so would mean that everything we know and hold dear will be lost to the Legion.$B$BWe must focus on what we know, and that is that the Light must walk among us.$B$BWithin the Halls of Valor you will find an ascending val\'kyr by the name of Hyrja. Recover a spark of her Light and release it within our temple.' WHERE `ID` = 43377;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Eye of Azshara: Looking Through the Lens', `LogDescription` = 'Recover the Lens of the Tide from Lady Hatecoil within the Eye of Azshara dungeon.', `QuestDescription` = 'We have what we need to create Velen\'s elixir, but in order for others to be able to witness his vision, we\'ll need to find something that can be used to project images from the mind.$B$BA lens from the nearby naga should work well, but I don\'t think they\'re going to be too eager to give it up.' WHERE `ID` = 43378;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Velen\'s Vision', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Lens of the Tides to witness Prophet Velen\'s vision.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have everything I need to bring forth a vision, but the question remains: are you ready to witness it? Even the smallest glimpse into the future can weigh heavy on your soul.$B$BOnce I ingest the elixir, the vision will come quickly. Gazing into the Lens of the Tides will allow you to see what I see.$B$BLet me know when you are ready to begin.' WHERE `ID` = 43379;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Sol' WHERE `ID` = 43380;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Mariella Ward' WHERE `ID` = 43381;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Natalie Seline' WHERE `ID` = 43382;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Awakening the Light', `LogDescription` = 'Collect Pure Holy Light by completing Class Hall missions.', `QuestDescription` = 'This spark will only know its full potential once it\'s been filled with pure Light, gleaned from the holiest places in our world.$B$BNurture this spark, and it may grow to walk among you.' WHERE `ID` = 43383;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Demonic Runes', `LogDescription` = 'Collect Demonic Runestones from demons throughout the Broken Isles.', `QuestDescription` = 'I cannot stand by idly and allow the Legion to destroy our home. \n\nI\'ve been studying their language for some time, deciphering any runes I can get my hands on, but my supply is severely limited. \n\nIf I had more runes to study, it\'s possible that I may discover something that will help us in locating Balnazzar.' WHERE `ID` = 43384;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Infiltrating Our Enemies', `LogDescription` = 'Interact with the Command Map and complete the mission, "Infiltrating Our Enemies".', `QuestDescription` = 'With the Light at our side, we should focus our efforts on figuring out who among our enemies could be a potential ally.\n\nAny of your champions should be capable of infiltrating enemy ranks, giving us a better understanding of how to approach this.\n\nEven so, it is a delicate task. Proceed with caution.' WHERE `ID` = 43385;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Onslaught Envoy', `LogDescription` = 'Find a new ally among old enemies in New Hearthglen.', `QuestDescription` = 'A few defectors have been discovered among the Scarlet Onslaught in Northrend.$B$BI know it\'s difficult to think that any within their ranks could be useful to our cause, but we must make an attempt.$B$BThe prophecy says an old enemy will become an ally, so it\'s worth it to investigate and see if these defectors can be brought to the Light.' WHERE `ID` = 43386;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Scarlet Redemption', `LogDescription` = 'Help Mariella the Heretic redeem herself by killing members of the Scarlet Onslaught in New Hearthglen.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Light shines upon me, $n! For the first time in my life, I feel it!\n\nI was without hope, ready to die for the things I had done in the name of the Scarlet Crusade, but then you appeared! You are my chance at redemption. \n\nPlease, let me prove to you that I am worthy of a second chance. Let me slay those I used to be loyal to!' WHERE `ID` = 43387;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Apostate Liberation', `LogDescription` = 'Rescue Onslaught Apostates within New Hearthglen.', `QuestDescription` = 'There are others like me, you know. Others that have removed the veil that the Scarlet Crusade has kept over our eyes for so long. \n\nThey\'ve been placed in cages, treated like animals, simply because their beliefs no longer line up with what the Onslaught deems is right and holy. \n\nThey wish to redeem themselves. We should try to free them, if you think their lives are worth saving.' WHERE `ID` = 43388;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Unexpected Guests', `LogDescription` = 'Return to Alonsus Faol in Netherlight Temple.', `QuestDescription` = 'You helped me escape my fate by freeing me from the gallows, but allowing me to fight the Scarlet Onslaught by your side has truly freed my heart and mind from the guilt I have felt for so long.\n\nI want to be a part of something greater than myself, a noble cause that won\'t distort the meaning of the Light. \n\nLet me travel to your temple and beg forgiveness of the Prophet. I may not be a welcome guest, but it\'s a journey I must make to complete my redemption.' WHERE `ID` = 43389;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Forgotten Shadows', `LogDescription` = 'Head to Duskwood and meet with a member of the Cult of Forgotten Shadows.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Light walks among us, as does one of our enemies. You have done well to bring the prophecy to life, but it is not yet complete.\n\nThe shadows must rise, and to do so, the Cult of Forgotten Shadows must be restored. \n\nYou will find the few remaining followers at the cemetery in Duskwood. They linger there near the grave of their fallen leader.' WHERE `ID` = 43390;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Secrets of the Void', `LogDescription` = 'Recover Natalie\'s Journal from Twilight Lord Urgrok.', `QuestDescription` = 'Our leader was murdered for her beliefs, or so most would believe.\n\nNatalie Seline knew her fate, and took steps to protect herself from an inevitable death. \n\nThe night her attackers came, Natalie sent her spirit to the Void, its location known only to Natalie herself.\n\nShe penned a spell to retrieve it in one of her many journals, but the tome has since fallen into the hands of those who wished her dead in the first place.\n\nWithout her journal, we will never be able to recover her spirit.' WHERE `ID` = 43391;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Into the Void', `LogDescription` = 'Read Natalie\'s Journal at the catacomb\'s shadow altar to enter the void and recover her spirit.', `QuestDescription` = 'This is without a doubt Natalie\'s writing. The entry was scrawled in haste, but the message is clear: The spell within this journal will lead us to Natalie\'s spirit, but it needs to be incanted at a shadow altar within the catacombs.$B$BOdessa and I have a duty to watch over Natalie\'s body, but with your considerable power, you should be able to perform the spell with ease.' WHERE `ID` = 43392;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Rising Shadows', `LogDescription` = 'Return to Alonsus Faol at Netherlight Temple.', `QuestDescription` = 'News of my return will spread fast among those who share my beliefs. Soon Azeroth will see the rise of Shadows, but I imagine this is not news to you.\n\nWhatever your plan may be, I hope it continues to see the Cult of Forgotten Shadows as allies.' WHERE `ID` = 43393;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Crossing Legion Lines', `LogDescription` = 'Use the demon portal at Felblaze Ingress to enter Niskara and find Aponi Brightmane.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'ve received word from the Highlord that a group of paladins and priests were captured after a battle broke out at Felblaze Ingress. Your priestess, Delas Moonfang, was among those captured.$B$BThey\'ve been taken through the demon portal and into the Legion stronghold of Niskara.$B$BWe will need the assistance of the Conclave if we have any hope of recovering them.' WHERE `ID` = 43394;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Allies of the Light', `LogDescription` = 'Save Silver Hand Knights or Conclave Priests, and rescue Arator the Redeemer and Delas Moonfang.', `QuestDescription` = 'Both Arator and Delas are still somewhere on this forsaken rock, as well as many of our other allies.$B$BWe cannot leave them, $n.' WHERE `ID` = 43395;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Mind of the Enemy', `LogDescription` = 'Find the Legion Intelligence, Star Map, and Image of Velen, then slay Brood Queen Aramis.', `QuestDescription` = 'The demon jailors spoke of an upcoming invasion. Their army is gathering for something big, and it worries me greatly.$B$BLet us find whatever information we can about their plans.' WHERE `ID` = 43396;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'United As One', `LogDescription` = 'Make your way to the Sanctum of Light to speak with Lady Liadrin, and hear the council of war.', `QuestDescription` = 'You and Delas have had dealings with the paladins before, maybe it\'s possible they will grant you an audience with their war council. \n\nHead to the Sanctum of Light and ask the paladins to help us defend Netherlight Temple from Balnazzar\'s attack.' WHERE `ID` = 43397;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Alonsus Faol' WHERE `ID` = 43398;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fortifying the Temple', `LogDescription` = 'Complete 10 World Quests.', `QuestDescription` = 'We\'ve all worked so hard turning this temple into something all priests can be proud of, it would be a shame to see it fall to the Burning Legion.$B$BWe must strengthen our defenses in preparation for the attack. With the right resources, we can make the temple a nearly impenetrable fortress.' WHERE `ID` = 43399;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Lumenstone', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 50 Lumenstone by sending champions on "Lumenstone" missions.', `QuestDescription` = 'To prepare for the battle, we will need the best armor and weapons we can get.$B$BLumenstone is an enchanted material that can withstand great amounts of fel magic.$B$BIt is found in rare quantities all over the Broken Isles, and many of the native races use it in their own metalcrafting.$B$BWe should send our champions to target enemies around the Broken Isles - there should be plenty of lumenstone to be found in their stockpiles.' WHERE `ID` = 43400;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Light in the Darkness', `LogDescription` = 'United with the paladins, defend Netherlight Temple and slay Lord Balnazzar.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Burning Legion has begun their attack!$B$BI will remain here and prepare the temple\'s defenses. You must meet our allies in Dalaran and let them know that the battle has begun!$B$BMake haste, $n. I do not know how long we will be able to keep Balnazzar at bay.' WHERE `ID` = 43401;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'High Priest of Netherlight', `LogDescription` = 'Listen as you are honored by the Conclave of priests.', `QuestDescription` = 'You have fulfilled the prophecy, but more than that, you have united the priests of Azeroth.\n\nWe should take a moment to recognize all that you have accomplished.' WHERE `ID` = 43402;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Defending the Isles', `LogDescription` = 'Complete 10 World Quests.', `QuestDescription` = 'As druids, our charge is to defend nature... and in turn, our home, Azeroth.$B$BConflict breaks out all across the Broken Isles. The Burning Legion pushes forward, and numerous allies call out for our aid.$B$BWe must focus our efforts on defense, before we can mount an offense against the Nightmare.$B$BHelp our allies across the Broken Isles, then return to me when the situation is under control.' WHERE `ID` = 43403;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Da-Nel\'s Second Quest' WHERE `ID` = 43405;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Soul Forge and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'m pleased to report that the improvements to the Soul Forge are complete!$b$bWhen you are ready, we shall use it to unlock the true potential of your weapon!' WHERE `ID` = 43407;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Seed of Ages and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = '$ct, in our short time together you have done much to aid the Circle.$b$bWe are inspired by your determination and have developed a new technique that will bind the power of your weapon with the Emerald Dream itself!$b$bEverything is prepared. When you are ready we shall begin.' WHERE `ID` = 43409;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Cursed Forge of the Nathrezim and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'m pleased to report that the improvements to the Forge are complete!$b$bWhen you are ready, we shall use it to unlock the true potential of your weapon!' WHERE `ID` = 43412;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Felblood Altar and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = '$ct, our research into the Felblood Altar has proven useful. We\'ve developed a ritual that should unleash the full powers of your artifact weapon!$b$bSay the word, and we shall begin the ritual at once!' WHERE `ID` = 43414;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Forge of the Guardian and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = '$ct, in our short time together you have done much for our order.$b$bThrough your words and deeds we\'ve been inspired to redouble our efforts and I\'m proud to report that we\'ve discovered a new technique that may be of use to you.$b$bIf you have a moment, $ct, I would be pleased to show you the fruit of our research.' WHERE `ID` = 43415;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure', `PortraitGiverName` = 'King Anduin Wrynn' WHERE `ID` = 43416;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Ancient Elemental Altar and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = 'Farseer, since you have joined us you have done much to aid the Earthen Ring.$b$bYour efforts have not gone unnoticed. The spirits have watched all that you have done and are pleased. They also have shown me a technique that will unleash the true power of your weapon!$b$bThe ritual is ready. When you are prepared we can begin.' WHERE `ID` = 43418;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Altar of Light and Shadow and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = '$ct, in our short time together you have done much to aid the Conclave. Now, with the work upon the Altar of Light and Shadow complete, it is time that we aid you. We have discovered a method to awaken the full power of your weapon!$b$bPlease, step before the altar and raise your weapon high.' WHERE `ID` = 43420;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Raven Calls' WHERE `ID` = 43421;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Crucible of the Uncrowned and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'m pleased to say that the improvements to the crucible are complete!$b$bWhen you are prepared, we shall use it to unlock the true potential of your weapons!' WHERE `ID` = 43422;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Altar of the Eternal Hunt and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'m pleased to say that the improvements to the Altar of the Eternal Hunt are complete!$b$bWhen you are ready, we shall use it to unlock the full potential of your weapon!' WHERE `ID` = 43423;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Approach the indicated location before the Altar of Ancient Kings and raise your weapon.', `QuestDescription` = '$ct, you\'ve brought together the Silver Hand like no $ct has done before. You\'ve shown us that with determination and faith in the holy light we can overcome any challenge.$b$bFollowing in your example our workmen have toiled hard to improve the Altar of Ancient Kings, allowing it to unlock the true potential of your weapon.$b$bTheir work is now complete! Step forward when you are ready and we shall begin.' WHERE `ID` = 43424;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Hero\'s Weapon', `LogDescription` = 'Meet with Odyn at his forge and raise your weapon at the indicated location.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'ve been watching you, $n.$b$bTime and again you\'ve led the Valarjar to war with your weapon held high! Time and again the halls of Valhalas have thundered with the cheers of your victory!$b$bNow that the enhancements to the forge have been completed, it is time that your weapon\'s true potential be unleashed! Meet with me at the forge, hero.' WHERE `ID` = 43425;
