UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Boarding the Fel Hammer' WHERE `ID` = 43467;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Blood for the Wolfe', `LogDescription` = 'Collect $1oa Fel Blood.', `QuestDescription` = 'We have a request in from Winstone Wolfe. He says that he needs a rather large amount of demon blood. He was not specific what for, and I did not ask.\n\nI am inclined to do this for him with all expediency. The Wolf rarely asks for anything, so when he does, we jump. He gets results, one-hundred percent of the time and then some.\n\nWe should show him the same professional courtesy.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Return to Valeera Sanguinar in the Chamber of Shadows.' WHERE `ID` = 43468;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Where In the World is Mathias?', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Scouting Map and complete the "Where In the World is Mathias Shaw?" missions.', `QuestDescription` = 'Master Mathias Shaw is the leader of the Alliance intelligence organization known as SI:7. And apparently, he is now a dreadlord.\n\nOr rather, a very clever dreadlord has taken his place while he is being held captive somewhere.\n\nIt is imperative that we reveal this imposter to the new king of Stormwind. If we fail to do so, then the Alliance will surely be eaten alive from within and the Burning Legion will win this war for a certainty.' WHERE `ID` = 43469;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Pruning the Garden', `LogDescription` = 'Complete 10 World Quests.', `QuestDescription` = 'In a very real sense, the Uncrowned are gardeners. We snip and trim here and there. One clipping of a single branch may seem nonsensical until you step back and look at the garden as a whole.\n\nOn the greater theater of the Broken Isles, we must act decisively. The forces that arrayed against Azeroth are moving quickly. We need to prune some very ugly flowers to make our garden beautiful again, wouldn\'t you agree, $n?', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Return to Taoshi in the Chamber of Shadows.' WHERE `ID` = 43470;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Historians', `LogDescription` = 'Meet with Historian Llore in the Royal Library of Stormwind.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, each year I visit Stormwind to help adventurers like you reflect on our shared history. While our eyes must always be trained on the future, we must be mindful of our past. Come visit me in the Stormwind Royal Library and we can speak more.' WHERE `ID` = 43471;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Historians', `LogDescription` = 'Meet with Historian Ju\'Pa in the Valley of Spirits of Orgrimmar.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, each year I visit Orgrimmar to help adventurers like you reflect on our shared history. While our eyes must always be trained on the future, we must be mindful of our past. Come visit me in the Valley of Spirits and we can speak more.' WHERE `ID` = 43472;
