UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Hidden History', `LogDescription` = 'Use the scouting notes to locate and recover the 4 ancient tomes Fjornson needs to begin research on your artifact.', `QuestDescription` = 'You wield ancient steel, strengthened by magics we barely understand.\n\nIf you truly want to unlock the potential of your weapons, you need to know more of how they were forged, and of the battles they\'ve fought in. I can help with this.\n\nYour races use books to store their histories, and I will need some of these to piece together the legend of your steel. I asked one of your followers to look into their locations for me. Here are her notes.' WHERE `ID` = 43826;
