UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Hitting the Books', `LogDescription` = 'Start a Research Work Order.', `QuestDescription` = 'Any death knight worth their salt knows the weapon they wield as if they were born with it.  But you now carry a weapon older than any in this hall.\n\nIf we truly want to unlock all of its potential, we need to learn more about it. It will take time and more eyes than just mine to sift through all this history, translate it, and turn it into something meaningful.\n\nWe should prioritize some of the order\'s resources towards this research. I promise you it will be worth every minute.' WHERE `ID` = 43877;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Hitting the Books', `LogDescription` = 'Start a Research Work Order.', `QuestDescription` = 'A demon hunter is nothing without blades with which to cut flesh. Yet those you wield are older than even you... and have power we don\'t understand yet.\n\nIf you truly want to unlock all of their potential, we need to learn more about them. It will take time and more eyes than just mine to sift through all this history, translate it, and turn it into something meaningful.\n\nWe should prioritize some of the order\'s resources towards this research. I promise you it will be worth every minute.' WHERE `ID` = 43878;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Hitting the Books', `LogDescription` = 'Start a Research Work Order.', `QuestDescription` = 'You have a weapon both ancient and powerful. And yet, we barely understand it. If we truly want to unlock all of its potential, we need to learn more about it. That\'s where I come in. It\'s my specialty.\n\nStill, it will take time and more eyes than just mine to sift through all this history, translate it, and turn it into something meaningful.\n\nWe should prioritize some of the order\'s resources towards this research. I promise you it will be worth every minute.' WHERE `ID` = 43879;
