UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Hitting the Books', `LogDescription` = 'Start a Research Work Order.', `QuestDescription` = 'You have a mighty weapon with a long history, one we barely understand. If we truly want to unlock all of its potential, we need to learn more about it. I can get workin\' on that for ya.\n\nStill, it\'ll take time and more eyes than just mine to sift through all this history, translate it, and turn it into something meaningful.\n\nWe should prioritize some of the order\'s resources towards this research. It will be worth every minute.' WHERE `ID` = 43883;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Hitting the Books', `LogDescription` = 'Start a Research Work Order.', `QuestDescription` = 'You have a weapon both ancient and powerful. And yet, we barely understand it. If we truly want to unlock all of its potential, we need to learn more about it. I can do this for you.\n\nStill, it will take time and more eyes than just mine to sift through all this history, translate it, and turn it into something meaningful.\n\nWe should prioritize some of the order\'s resources towards this research. It will be worth every minute.' WHERE `ID` = 43884;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Hitting the Books', `LogDescription` = 'Start a Research Work Order.', `QuestDescription` = 'Your weapons are undeniably powerful, but we know near nothing about\'m.\n\nIf we want to unlock all of their potential, we need to dig up some dirt on how they work, what they\'ve done... get to know them, ya know? That\'s where I come in. I dig up dirt all the time. I mean, not literally, but... you know what I mean.\n\nIt will take time and more eyes than just mine to sift through all this. We should prioritize some of the order\'s resources towards this research. It will be worth every minute.' WHERE `ID` = 43885;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Speaking to the Wind', `LogDescription` = 'Start a Research Work Order.', `QuestDescription` = 'You have a weapon both ancient and powerful. We know stories of it, but little about its origins.\n\nIf we truly want to unlock all of its potential, we need to learn more about it. The winds can help us with this, but we need to know what to ask.\n\nIt will take more shaman than just myself to learn everything there is to know about this artifact of yours. We should prioritize some of the order\'s resources towards this research. It will be worth every minute.' WHERE `ID` = 43886;
