UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Growing Crisis', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Valewalker Farodin at the Temple of Fala\'dora. You can travel there using the Portal to Falanaar in Shal\'aran.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Arcan\'dor is failing.\n\nThis energy was once bound in its boughs and fueled its growth. There was balance, between life and arcane.\n\nNow that energy is breaking free. When the heart can no longer hold it, this tree will kill every living thing in this hall.\n\nI have seen this happen before and I must find a way to stop it from happening again. \n\nWe must go to the tree that came before. Its bones can guide us.\n\nMeet me at the temple of Fal\'adora. We will descend together.' WHERE `ID` = 44152;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Light\'s Charge', `LogDescription` = 'Place Light\'s Heart in your Order Hall.', `QuestDescription` = '"You did not ask for this burden, but it is what fate has deemed." Turalyon\'s haunting last words still echo in my mind. I worry about the fate of the draenei... about the fate of my friend, Velen; but we must remain vigilant, $n!$B$BFor now, Light\'s Heart remains under your watchful eye. There is one place on Azeroth that I would trust with the safekeeping of the object: your order hall. Take it there, $n. I will remain in Dalaran and continue looking for answers. There must be another way!' WHERE `ID` = 44153;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Rite of the Executioner', `LogDescription` = 'Interact with the Pile of Skulls and complete the Rite of the Executioner in the crypt near Morgan\'s Plot in Deadwind Pass.', `QuestDescription` = 'The skulls have been gathered and the ritual area is prepared.\n\nAll that is left is to perform the incantation, and Ulthalesh will become imbued with the essence of the Executioner.' WHERE `ID` = 44154;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Searching For Clues', `LogDescription` = 'Find proof of SI:7 working with The Red Blade.', `QuestDescription` = 'It be no coincidence that we be in Citrine Bay investigatin\' a murder, and we find th\' band \'o pirates known as th\' Red Blade here as well!$b$bAye, this be no coincidence at all, $n... but we be needin\' proof!$b$bYe go on ahead and look fer clues and I\'ll find some scallywags to interrogate.$b$bAye $n, we\'ll get t\' \'th bottom o\' this t\' be sure! Thar be no doubt!' WHERE `ID` = 44155;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Another Arcan\'dor Closes...', `LogDescription` = 'Return to Shal\'aran.', `QuestDescription` = 'I hope you have a better understanding of what is at stake.\n\nCome. There is no more for us to do here.\n\nMeet me in Shal\'aran and we will discuss what steps we may take next.' WHERE `ID` = 44156;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Withered Wrangling: Tel\'anor' WHERE `ID` = 44157;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Withered Wrangling: Falanaar' WHERE `ID` = 44158;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Ticket for Marin', `LogDescription` = 'Deliver the Vault Ticket to Marin Noggenfogger.', `QuestDescription` = 'This Vault Ticket should be delivered to Marin Noggenfogger.' WHERE `ID` = 44159;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Things Gaardoun Needs', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Scouting Map and complete the mission, "Things Gaardoun Needs".', `QuestDescription` = 'Battlelord Gaardoun has offered to recruit more broken warriors for the cause. He just needs a few things first. He said something about the right tool for the job, or something like that.\n\nTime to put your new champions to the test. I\'m sure it will be a grueling mission.' WHERE `ID` = 44161;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Burning Path Through Time', `LogDescription` = 'Complete 5 Timewalking dungeons.', `QuestDescription` = 'The blazing star shines upon the land, searing the earth and parching the landscape. This star is relentless, malevolent almost. While its influence holds, new paths may open up, to distant places and even distant times. No sage truly understands the nature of this sign, but fortune favors the daring.' WHERE `ID` = 44164;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Frozen Path Through Time', `LogDescription` = 'Complete 5 Timewalking dungeons.', `QuestDescription` = 'The chill star shines upon the land with its cold light as even the spirits retreat to the shadows. This star is unlike any other in the skies, sapping warmth and life. While its influence holds, new paths may open up, to distant places and even distant times. No sage truly understands the nature of this sign, but fortune favors the daring.' WHERE `ID` = 44166;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Shattered Path Through Time', `LogDescription` = 'Complete 5 Timewalking dungeons.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Destroyer\'s star shines upon the land with its piercing light as even the spirits retreat to the shadows. This star is unlike any other in the skies, laying bare the weaknesses of even the boldest heroes. While its influence holds, new paths may open up, to distant places and even distant times. No sage truly understands the nature of this sign, but fortune favors the daring.' WHERE `ID` = 44167;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Emissary of War', `LogDescription` = 'Complete 4 dungeons on Mythic difficulty.', `QuestDescription` = 'When the sign of the warrior shines in the night sky, fortune favors the daring. Powerful foes may yield even greater rewards. Venture deep into caverns and strongholds to prove your worth.' WHERE `ID` = 44171;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Arena Calls', `LogDescription` = 'Win 10 Arena Skirmish battles.', `QuestDescription` = 'This alignment of the stars is a dire sign, stirring bloodlust and calling warriors to battle to the death in close quarters. Arena masters turn a tidy profit during these days, likely not understanding why their stands are overflowing. Amidst the excitement, great rewards do await those brave, or foolhardy, enough to venture into the arena....' WHERE `ID` = 44172;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Call to Battle', `LogDescription` = 'Win 4 Battleground matches.', `QuestDescription` = 'The favorite star of warlords and generals dominates the sky, offering good fortune to tacticians everywhere. Some say that the battle star hones the instincts of commanders to the point of near-prophecy. If ever you were going to test yourself on the field of battle, now is the time.' WHERE `ID` = 44173;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Very Best', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat 5 players through Find Battle with a team of level 25 pets.', `QuestDescription` = 'This alignment of the stars is truly a strange one, causing the tiniest of creatures to gain unnatural aptitude. None of our sages can explain the phenomenon, but cunning tamers have much to gain, especially by testing their skills against those of their peers.' WHERE `ID` = 44174;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The World Awaits', `LogDescription` = 'Complete 20 World Quests in the Broken Isles.', `QuestDescription` = 'When the sign of the emissary shines in the night sky, the stars strengthen existing bonds and forge new ones. Friendship is still not cheaply won, and deeds will prove loyalty, but trust comes more readily during these days. Venture across the Broken Isles, and give aid where you may, to prove your worth.' WHERE `ID` = 44175;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Conveniences of Home', `LogDescription` = 'Take the Traveler\'s Banking Chest to Shal\'aran.', `QuestDescription` = 'This chest could prove very useful to our efforts. Take the chest back to Shal\'aran.' WHERE `ID` = 44176;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Dark Secrets and Shady Deals', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Lord Ravenholdt.', `QuestDescription` = 'Whatever Amber Kearnen knew, Mathias Shaw didn\'t want it gettin\' out...$b$bAye, this be dirty business indeed, hiring th\' Red Blade at such a price... just to hunt down and kill one of their own!$b$bYe best get back to th\' Hall \'o Shadows, and let Lord Ravenholdt know what we found here in Citrine Bay.$b$bWhatever SI:7 be up to, it be goin\' deeper than we first imagined...' WHERE `ID` = 44177;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Particularly Potent Potion', `LogDescription` = 'Steal Love Potion #6 from Gallywix\'s personal safe.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'ve got a proposition for ya, $n!$b$bWord has it that Trade Prince Gallywix recently acquired a priceless, one-of-a-kind love potion. There\'s only one goblin who can replicate it and you\'re looking at him! Get me that potion and I can make us both richer than kings!$b$bThe pleasure palace is located in Azshara and it has been on high alert since the war started. Gallywix isn\'t letting anybody in except his personal staff, but I know a girl on the inside!$b$bFind her and she\'ll get you to the safe!', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Return to Marin Noggenfogger.' WHERE `ID` = 44178;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Valtrois.', `QuestDescription` = 'There is a strange energy in the air.\n\nI feel as if a force is growing, pressing down on us. It is worrisome.\n\nValtrois works most closely with the sources of power in this room.\n\nSpeak to her. Ask if there is anything to be concerned with.' WHERE `ID` = 44179;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Marin Noggenfogger' WHERE `ID` = 44180;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Fleet Admiral Tethys' WHERE `ID` = 44181;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'City Under Siege', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Khadgar at the Chamber of the Guardian in Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = '<Khadgar\'s voice erupts from the elemental once again.>$B$BObtaining information on the Pillars of Creation before the Legion could stop us was a considerable victory. It won\'t bring back those we lost on the Broken Shore, but I believe it will help us avenge them.$b$bDalaran has become a focal point of the Legion\'s assault. Your presence here is crucial. If the demons are putting this much effort into attacking the city, it means Dalaran will play a pivotal role in the struggle to save Azeroth.' WHERE `ID` = 44182;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Lord Jorach Ravenholdt' WHERE `ID` = 44183;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'In the Blink of an Eye', `LogDescription` = 'Witness the teleportation of Dalaran to the Broken Isles.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Broken Isles is our destination, $n.$b$bThe spell that will blink Dalaran to its new location is not a simple one. It will take this Council\'s full energy and attention.$b$bAs Jaina is... absent, Kalecgos of the blue dragonflight has offered us his aid.$b$bThe Legion will make every attempt to stop us, but we will not falter. It is time to begin!' WHERE `ID` = 44184;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Sanaar' WHERE `ID` = 44185;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'WANTED: Broodmother Shu\'malis' WHERE `ID` = 44186;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Cinderwing' WHERE `ID` = 44187;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Special Army of the Dead Summoned' WHERE `ID` = 44188;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Bestrix' WHERE `ID` = 44189;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Jade Darkhaven' WHERE `ID` = 44190;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Lysanis Shadesoul' WHERE `ID` = 44192;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Sea King Tidross' WHERE `ID` = 44193;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DANGER: Torrentius' WHERE `ID` = 44194;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Workorders for Armaments', `LogDescription` = 'Place a workorder for a shipment of Champion Armaments and Equipment.', `QuestDescription` = 'I can get you the best deals on some slightly... used... equipment.' WHERE `ID` = 44195;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Mathias Visit Not Active 04' WHERE `ID` = 44199;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'For the Cause' WHERE `ID` = 44202;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'For the Cause' WHERE `ID` = 44203;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Seal their Fates', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for a Seal of Broken Fate.', `QuestDescription` = 'Ever feel like luck just isn\'t on your side?  Well maybe I can help you with that.  \n\nThere are some interesting items I\'ve come across in my travels which can be used to swing the dice in your favor, or at least give you another shot at it.  It takes some time, and supplies are hard to come by, but I can get you one of them... for a price?' WHERE `ID` = 44204;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Shape Your Fate', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for a Seal of Broken Fate.', `QuestDescription` = 'The whims of the spirits can be guided, I have seen it.\n\nThere were whispers of an item, a way to change the path of destiny.  I heard dem, and I went looking.  For many years I listened to those whispers on the wind until one day they showed me the way.  This is what I offer you.  It will take some time, and some valuable resources, but I can perform the ritual to allow you to control this power.\n\nWell?  Are you ready?' WHERE `ID` = 44205;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Ascended', `LogDescription` = 'Place a request to recruit Ascendants.', `QuestDescription` = 'These shaman have spent their lives dedicated to the path of Air, Water or Fire.  On your request, we will beseech the elements to Ascend them, becoming a powerful, if short lived, force to deploy in this war against the Legion.\n\nThe ritual of ascension is not to be requested lightly.' WHERE `ID` = 44206;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Portal Full of Shiny Things', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for Champion armaments and equipment.', `QuestDescription` = 'When I heard the Hall of the Guardian was open again, I said to myself "Minuette, this is your chance!" I rushed over here thinking I\'d be hurled into the front lines.  Imagine it, me, little old me, assaulting Demons with missiles, blinking away from Fel Meteors.  That would be brilliant!\n\nInstead, they send me over here and say "Hey, open up some portals so we can throw things through, would you?" At least I get to charge something for it.' WHERE `ID` = 44207;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fate and Time', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for a Seal of Broken Fate.', `QuestDescription` = 'For years we wondered, we conjectured, that it was possible to control the twisting, slipping, streaming threads of fate and destiny.  These books tell of powerful mages who embraced the manipulation of time.  No no, not like Time Warp, they would laugh at us, think us silly amateurs.  No, they were true Chronomancers.\n\nThe only spell we\'ve been able to determine is a conjuration.  It calls forth what they termed  a "Seal of Fate".  This allowed them to repeat their actions.  Let us try it out shall we?' WHERE `ID` = 44208;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Might of Dalaran', `LogDescription` = 'Channel the power of Dalaran into the focusing crystal, then unleash it to complete a World Quest.', `QuestDescription` = 'In times of great need, the mages of Dalaran can focus their power into one pure, destructive form.  This is such a time.\n\nOn request, these mages will channel that power into a focusing crystal, which we will impart to you.  Use it to unleash that power, completing a quest of great value.' WHERE `ID` = 44209;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Might of Dalaran pt2', `LogDescription` = 'Collect the Focusing Crystal and use it to complete a world quest.', `QuestDescription` = 'Yes, now once the crystal has been empowered, collect it here, and use it to unleash the power of our mages on a world quest.' WHERE `ID` = 44210;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Unseen Armaments', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for Champion armaments and equipment.', `QuestDescription` = 'If we gonna win dis war, we need to get these Champions of ours better equipment.  \n\nIt won\'t be cheap, or easy, but I can get dem for you.' WHERE `ID` = 44211;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Unseen Fate', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for a Seal of Broken Fate.', `QuestDescription` = 'Our path is a winding, twisting road full of peril.  Yet did you know it can be walked many times?  There is an item of great power available to us.  It allows us another opportunity, a second chance.\n\nDo you wish to acquire one?' WHERE `ID` = 44212;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'You Will Be Prepared!', `LogDescription` = 'Accept a gift from the Illidari.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, your strength and leadership inspires awe in all of us!\n\nThe Illidari are prepared to furnish you with a full set of armor to aid in the fight against the Burning Legion. Continue expanding your influence across the Broken Isles, and we may yet achieve victory.' WHERE `ID` = 44213;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'One More Thing...', `LogDescription` = 'Head down to the chamber of the Cursed Forge of the Nathrezim on the lower level of the Fel Hammer.', `QuestDescription` = 'Well done, Slayer. You are truly now the leader of the Illidari. But there\'s one more thing.\n\nMeet me down at the forge.' WHERE `ID` = 44214;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'One More Thing...', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Lord Ravenholdt in the Uncrowned Vault.', `QuestDescription` = 'Firstly, allow me to congratulate you. I know of no one more deserving of the title of Shadowblade. But there\'s one more thing.\n\nMeet me over near the forge.' WHERE `ID` = 44215;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Armor Fit For A Deathlord', `LogDescription` = 'Accept a gift from the Knights of the Ebon Blade.', `QuestDescription` = '$n is strong! $n is great leader!\n\nEbon Blade want to give you full set of armor to help with the little demon killing. Get stronger, make demons more dead!' WHERE `ID` = 44217;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion Armaments', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for Champion armaments and equipment.', `QuestDescription` = 'This war against the Legion won\'t be won easily.  We will need armaments and equipment for our Champions.  \n\nGive the order sir, I\'ll get the word out and have a shipment brought in.' WHERE `ID` = 44218;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fate\'s Blessing', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for a Seal of Broken Fate.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Light\'s blessing is powerful. We use it to mend, to defeat our enemies... we even use it to resurrect our allies. Did you know it can also be used to alter your destiny?  \n\nThe Silver Hand is able to procure a valuable item to help you in our war against the Legion. This Seal can be used at the most opportune moments to grant another chance at destiny.  \n\nShall we procure one for you?' WHERE `ID` = 44219;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Blessing of the Order', `LogDescription` = 'Send out the call to bring together the Vanguard, then unleash it to complete a World Quest.', `QuestDescription` = 'In times of great need, the Order can rally its mightiest forces into one pure, destructive form.  This is such a time.\n\nOn request, we will channel our power into a Libram, which we will impart to you.  Use it to unleash that power, completing a quest of great value.' WHERE `ID` = 44220;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion Armaments', `LogDescription` = 'Place a workorder for Champion armaments and equipment.', `QuestDescription` = 'A warrior lives and dies by his weapons and armor.  For a price, we can provide you with a shipment for armaments to equip your Champions with.\n\nDo we have a deal?' WHERE `ID` = 44221;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Might of the Val\'kyr', `LogDescription` = 'Rise the power of the Val\'kyr, then unleash it to complete a World Quest.', `QuestDescription` = 'In times of great need, the Val\'kyr can rally its mightiest forces into one pure, destructive form.  This is such a time.\n\nOn request, these we will channel our power into a Horn, which we will impart to you.  Use it to unleash that power, completing a quest of great value.' WHERE `ID` = 44222;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion Armaments', `LogDescription` = 'Place a workorder for Champion armaments and equipment.', `QuestDescription` = 'We will need armaments and equipment for our Champions.' WHERE `ID` = 44223;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Unleashing our Wrath', `LogDescription` = 'Channel the power of the Hammer, then unleash it to complete a World Quest.', `QuestDescription` = 'In times of great need, we can rally our  mightiest forces into one pure, destructive form.  This is such a time.\n\nOn request, these we will channel our power into an item, which we will impart to you.  Use it to unleash that power, completing a quest of great value.' WHERE `ID` = 44224;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fate Favors Us', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for a Seal of Broken Fate.', `QuestDescription` = 'We are able to procure a valuable item to help you in our war against the Legion. This Seal can be used at the most opportune moments to grant another chance at destiny.  \n\nShall we procure one for you?' WHERE `ID` = 44226;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Unleashing our Wrath', `LogDescription` = 'Begin the ritual to enslave the infernal, then unleash it to complete a World Quest.', `QuestDescription` = 'In times of great need, we can rally our mightiest forces into one pure, destructive form.  This is such a time.\n\nOn request, these we will begin the ritual to enslave a powerful Infernal in a Demonic Phylactery, which we will impart to you.  Use it to unleash that power, completing a quest of great value.' WHERE `ID` = 44227;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion Armaments', `LogDescription` = 'Place a work order for Champion armaments and equipment.', `QuestDescription` = 'See Lurr?  He big and strong, but not so smart, not like Murr.  Murr can make Lurr build good things for you, things for your Champions to wear and be smashier.  \n\nFirst, you give Murr something?' WHERE `ID` = 44228;
