UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = '7.1 Class Hall - Special - PVP - PVP Intro Mission - Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 45171;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'To Battle!', `LogDescription` = 'Join and win in any battleground.', `QuestDescription` = 'Your champions have returned from exploring the battleground with a report detailing wild adventures and death-defying feats of strength and honor. In these ever shifting battles of conquest, more assistance is always required.\n\nWill you answer the call?' WHERE `ID` = 45172;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Desperate Times', `LogDescription` = 'Join and win in any battleground.', `QuestDescription` = 'The conflict continues. As always, your assistance is needed in the great battlegrounds. Join the fray, defeat your enemies, and win glory for your faction.' WHERE `ID` = 45173;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Hunt for Illidan Stormrage', `LogDescription` = 'Seek out Allari the Souleater at Illidari Stand in Azsuna.', `QuestDescription` = 'Allari the Souleater, an oracle of the Illidari, has been on the hunt for Illidan\'s soul for quite some time. She now believes that she has discovered its location and requires your assistance in its recovery.$B$BFind Allari at Illidari Stand in Azsuna and aid her in any way possible.$B$BIf Sargeras truly plans to use Illidan\'s body as a vessel for his own return then returning Illidan\'s soul to his body is integral in preventing the dark titan from returning to our world!' WHERE `ID` = 45174;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Soul Prism of the Illidari', `LogDescription` = 'Claim 40 Lingering Soul Fragments from the final bosses of Legion dungeons.$B$BHigher difficulty dungeons provide a greater chance and quantity of Lingering Soul Fragments.', `QuestDescription` = 'Alas, I will not burden you with the location of the master\'s soul just yet, $n. First we must craft a soul prism powerful enough to hold the master\'s boundless chaotic energies.$B$BTo do this I require lingering soul fragments from powerful beings found across this world. Bring me enough and I will craft a soul prism capable of holding the soul of the master - at least long enough to transfer into the naaru.' WHERE `ID` = 45175;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Trial of Valor: The Once and Future Lord of Shadows', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Helya in the Trials of Valor raid and then use the Soul Prism of the Illidari to claim Illidan\'s Soul.', `QuestDescription` = 'While tracking the master\'s physical body proved challenging, we were able to locate it in the Nighthold of Suramar. Our intelligence reports that Gul\'dan is making final preparations to the Nightwell in order to use its power to usher the soul of Sargeras into Illidan\'s body.$B$BThe only way to stop that from happening is to put Illidan\'s own immortal soul back.$B$BTake the Soul Prism of the Illidari and venture to Helheim. Defeat Helya and use the prism on Illidan\'s soul! Return it to Light\'s Heart.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Return the Soul Prism of the Illidari to Light\'s Heart in your Order Hall.' WHERE `ID` = 45176;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Nighthold', `LogDescription` = 'Deliver Light\'s Heart to Khadgar at the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = 'Illidan\'s soul rests safely within Light\'s Heart. Take this vessel and deliver it to Khadgar with the following instructions:$B$BWhen Gul\'dan attempts to tear the sky asunder and bring the dark titan into our world, call forth the power of this vessel and release Illidan\'s soul into his body.$B$BGo now, $n. We do not have much time. The dark ritual will begin soon.' WHERE `ID` = 45177;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Contagion Containment' WHERE `ID` = 45178;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Win the Crowd', `LogDescription` = 'Fight and win in the arena.', `QuestDescription` = 'The letter invites you to fight in one of the greatest events in the history of Azeroth. The grand arena battles, where fighters win glory and honor, and everyone will remember their names. Or at least until the next season.' WHERE `ID` = 45179;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'An Island of War', `LogDescription` = 'Complete the quests in Ashran.', `QuestDescription` = 'Your champions return weary and wounded. They bear a banner which, when placed in your hands, gives you a sense of foreboding, but also a surge of battle lust. They report to you of an island named Ashran, where heroes are constantly waging a war. The tides push back and forth, each side feinting and thrusting, always trying to gain the upper hand.\n\nAshran needs your help, will you answer the call?' WHERE `ID` = 45180;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = '7.1 Class Hall - Special - PVP - PVP Repeated - Battleground - Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 45181;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Frost: The Twisted Twin', `LogDescription` = 'Meet with Karam Magespear at the Legerdemain Lounge in Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have a request from an old friend, Karam Magespear, to help find his brother, Raest. Karam fears that Raest is dealing with dark powers, and wishes to stop him.\n\nOriginally Raest trained with the Kirin Tor, but such were his aspirations of power that he turned to the forbidden art of Necromancy. He was discovered and expelled from our order.\n\nFind Karam in the Legerdemain Lounge and see if you can lend a hand.\n\n|cFF660000Specialization: Frost Mage|r' WHERE `ID` = 45182;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = '7.1 Class Hall - Special - PVP - PVP Repeated - Ashran - Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 45183;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = '7.1 Class Hall - Special - PVP - PVP Repeated - Arena - Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 45184;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Message from the Shadows', `LogDescription` = 'Search the upper room in the Legerdemain Lounge for a clue to Raest Magespear\'s location.', `QuestDescription` = 'I know my brother has been misguided in the past, but I fear that he may have fallen in with an unthinkable evil. He recently began meeting in secret with a dark cult, hidden amongst the people of Dalaran.\n\nI travelled here to try to convince him of the error in his ways, but he would not be shaken from his course. Now, he has disappeared. \n\nWhen I last saw him, Raest was staying in a room upstairs. I was unable to find any clues there, but you might fare better.' WHERE `ID` = 45185;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure 023 - Sargeras Tower 001' WHERE `ID` = 45186;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Secrets in the Underbelly', `LogDescription` = 'Question the Underbelly Lowlifes in the Underbelly to find more information about Raest Magespear\'s location.', `QuestDescription` = 'So my brother has gone off to perform some ritual with these cultists? That explains why he left, but still not to where...\n\nWait! This letter mentions some of these "Nethersworn" cultists seeking reagents in the Underbelly. Perhaps we still may be able to find them if we hurry!' WHERE `ID` = 45187;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Wisdom of the Council', `LogDescription` = 'Bring the Nethersworn Manifesto to Archmage Karlain in the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'m sorry, $n, but I can\'t make heads nor tails of this. Riddles have never exactly been my strength.\n\nWe should take this cultist\'s writings to the archmage. Perhaps he could shed some light on this.' WHERE `ID` = 45188;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure 024 - Fel River Rock' WHERE `ID` = 45189;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Where it\'s Thinnest', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Karam Magespear at Felbreach Hollow in the Broken Shore.', `QuestDescription` = 'Though I have never heard of this "Nethersworn" cult, what this manifesto speaks of can\'t be good.\n\nI do have a theory, however. The writing speaks of "the place its skin is thinnest." I think they might be referring to the place where the veil between Azeroth and the Twisting Nether is weakest - the Tomb of Sargeras. \n\nWith our forces having established a foothold at the Broken Shore, this would be an opportune time for Raest and his cultist allies to reach the tomb. I would suggest you stop them.' WHERE `ID` = 45190;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure 025 - Night Elf Ruins 001' WHERE `ID` = 45191;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Runes of Rending', `LogDescription` = 'Bypass the wards in Felbreach Hollow and confront Raest Magespear.', `QuestDescription` = 'My brother and his cultists are engaged in some kind of ritual at the far end of the cave. I tried to intervene, but my brother has left magical wards to block the way.\n\nIf you can find a way past them, we may be able to stop him in time!' WHERE `ID` = 45192;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'One Step Behind', `LogDescription` = 'Return to Khadgar in the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = 'It looks like Raest is out of our reach, but at least his cultists should prove less of a threat.\n\nWe should return to the Kirin Tor. They should be able to help us plan our next move.' WHERE `ID` = 45193;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure 026 - Fallen Fel Tower' WHERE `ID` = 45198;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure 027 - Kirin Tor Tower' WHERE `ID` = 45199;
