UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Administering Aid', `LogDescription` = 'Apply the Contagion Counteragent to sickly Legionfall Fighters.', `QuestDescription` = 'Unfortunately, it would seem many of your allies have already taken to fighting on these fel corrupted shores. \n\nThey will never be able to gain the upper hand in battle while so many are suffering from the contagion. \n\nTake the counteragent and use it to administer aid to your allies. \n\nRoland and I will handle the injuries here.' WHERE `ID` = 45342;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Curious Contagion', `LogDescription` = 'Find Aelthalyste in Highmountain.', `QuestDescription` = 'It has been brought to my attention that a rather curious contagion is spreading through a small coastal region within Highmountain.$B$BThe local tribes have abandoned the area for fear of catching this ailment that currently has no known cure.$B$BOne of our own was traveling through the area when her companion fell ill. She has requested the Conclave\'s assistance. Seek her out, High Priest, and do whatever you can to stop this sickness from spreading.' WHERE `ID` = 45343;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Sampling the Source', `LogDescription` = 'Collect Contaminated Specimens from pools of Gaseous Fel around the western coast of Highmountain.', `QuestDescription` = 'My companion has fallen terribly ill, as you can see. \n\nHe must have caught whatever these taurens had. Their entire camp has been wiped out!\n\nIt appears to be fel in origin, and impervious to all known treatments. \n\nI\'ve been working tirelessly to find a cure, but I don\'t think Roland here has much time left. \n\nI could use an extra hand. Some samples from the source should speed things up. \n\nJust be sure to avoid direct contact with the contagion. Levitate should be helpful.' WHERE `ID` = 45344;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Mischievous Sprites', `LogDescription` = 'Use Dispel Magic on Soothoof Hillstriders to reveal Mischievous Sprites and collect their Shimmering Dust.', `QuestDescription` = 'It\'s a little-known secret that the dust sprites use for their various tricks has restorative properties.$B$BSome within the alchemy community balk at this claim, but they only refute it because they\'ve never been able to get their hands on the rare ingredient.$B$BSprites often shroud themselves in illusions to avoid detection.$B$BThe nearby goats have a curious shimmer about them that suggests they may be sprites in disguise.$B$BDispel whatever magic surrounds them to reveal their true form.' WHERE `ID` = 45345;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Shambling Specimens', `LogDescription` = 'Use Shackle Undead on Shambling Corpses in order to collect specimens with the Corpse Collector.', `QuestDescription` = 'This fel contagion appears to have three stages.$B$BThe first is marked by a persistent, phlegmy cough.$B$BThe second shows the skin turning a sickly shade of green.$B$BThe third involves a complete transformation where the victim turns into a mindless corpse. It is within this stage that I believe the most information about the sickness can be gathered.$B$BI have a contraption that can safely store the specimens, but they will need to be shackled before they can be collected.' WHERE `ID` = 45346;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Crafting a Cure', `LogDescription` = 'Infuse the Untested Cure with magic before administering it to Roland Abernathy.', `QuestDescription` = 'I used what you gathered for me to craft what I hope will be a reliable cure. The only thing that\'s missing is some powerful magic, which I hope you\'ll be able to provide.$B$BThe concoction is there on my alchemy table.$B$BPlease hurry, $n. Roland grows weaker by the minute.' WHERE `ID` = 45347;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Safekeeping', `LogDescription` = 'Take the Contagion Counteragent to Alonsus Faol in Netherlight Temple.', `QuestDescription` = 'It would seem that a delicate balance of holy and shadow magic is the key to curing this contagion. Obviously the remedy will need a bit of work to reduce undesired side effects, like dying.$B$BIn the meantime, take the counteragent back to Netherlight Temple and keep it safe. I will work diligently on discovering the source of this contagion.' WHERE `ID` = 45348;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'To the Broken Shore', `LogDescription` = 'Head to the Broken Shore.', `QuestDescription` = 'We\'ve received word from those fighting on the Broken Shore. It seems the source of the contagion can be pinpointed to a specific island off the western coast.$B$BMany of our allies have already been infected. We must work quickly to ensure that the contagion doesn\'t spread.' WHERE `ID` = 45349;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Countering the Contagion', `LogDescription` = 'Counter the contagion by killing Ozzuk the Corrupter and destroying his fel spreaders.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have tracked the source of the contagion to these very shores. The Burning Legion are using fel spreaders to pump out infectious fel creep, causing anyone who comes into contact with it to become sick.\n\nTake out Ozzuk the Corrupter and his fel spreaders so that the contagion can be contained.' WHERE `ID` = 45350;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Overloaded Soulshard' WHERE `ID` = 45351;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Touch of a Titan', `LogDescription` = 'Bring $1oa Essences of Aman\'Thul to Arcanomancer Vridiel.', `QuestDescription` = 'Oh my! You\'ve managed to acquire an item of legend to carry on your adventures. I\'ve long theorized that such items draw their power directly from the titans, and this may prove to be a chance to test such speculation!$b$bIt is said that the Nightwell draws power from the Eye of Aman\'Thul, and after centuries in close proximity I believe that titan\'s power now dwells within the inhabitants of the Nighthold. Bring me remnants of this energy, and I will empower your equipment.' WHERE `ID` = 45352;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Touch of a Titan', `LogDescription` = 'Bring $1oa Essences of Aman\'Thul to Arcanomancer Vridiel.', `QuestDescription` = 'Harnessing the strength of the titans may be the only thing that lets us push back the Burning Legion. Bring me more of this power, and we will improve your odds of defeating Gul\'dan.' WHERE `ID` = 45353;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Dispersion of the Discs', `LogDescription` = 'Complete the trial to purge the excess energy from within the disc fragments.', `QuestDescription` = 'These discs are radiating with power! It must be their proximity to one another. We must take them from here should they resonate further and cause a catastrophe in these sacred halls.$b$bI\'ll send them to the one place I know where we can reign their energies in, preventing any sort of explosion. I\'m speaking of the Eye of Eternity.$b$bThere we will be able to safely finish what Antonidas was unable to complete. Speak with me again when you\'re ready to leave.' WHERE `ID` = 45354;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Contagion Containment' WHERE `ID` = 45358;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure: Wand of Simulated Life' WHERE `ID` = 45365;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fel Shard' WHERE `ID` = 45368;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fate of the Nightborne', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Oculeth and meet Thalyssra in the Nighthold.', `QuestDescription` = 'Shortly after your victorious return from the Nighthold, urgent business took Thalyssra back to the palace.$b$bShe has requested that you meet her there.$b$bSpeak to me when you are prepared to join her.' WHERE `ID` = 45372;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Treasure Master Iks\'reeged', `LogDescription` = 'Slay $1oa Felwing Devourers.', `QuestDescription` = '<TEMP> Board the ship then kill fel bats.' WHERE `ID` = 45379;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Talisman of the Shal\'dorei', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 4 Echoes of Time from Elisande in The Nighthold on Normal Difficulty.', `QuestDescription` = 'When the Nighthold was built, my people forged a talisman that allowed access to these halls. With the talisman\'s power, one could traverse the palace unhindered, taking the fight directly to the magistrix. Using fragments of the Nightwell\'s power, we could locate the talisman and end this foolish war...' WHERE `ID` = 45381;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Talisman of the Shal\'dorei', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 4 Echoes of Time from Elisande in The Nighthold on Heroic Difficulty.', `QuestDescription` = 'When the Nighthold was built, my people forged a talisman that allowed access to these halls. With the talisman\'s power, one could traverse the palace unhindered, taking the fight directly to the magistrix. Using fragments of the Nightwell\'s power, we could locate the talisman and end this foolish war...' WHERE `ID` = 45382;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Talisman of the Shal\'dorei', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 4 Echoes of Time from Elisande in The Nighthold on Mythic Difficulty.', `QuestDescription` = 'When the Nighthold was built, my people forged a talisman that allowed access to these halls. With the talisman\'s power, one could traverse the palace unhindered, taking the fight directly to the magistrix. Using fragments of the Nightwell\'s power, we could locate the talisman and end this foolish war...' WHERE `ID` = 45383;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'We Must be Prepared!', `LogDescription` = 'Talk to Lady S\'theno at the Illidari Camp on the Broken Shore.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Legion ships are gone, for now. It\'s only a matter of time before they attack again, and we must be prepared.\n\nWe need to get going on repairs immediately! Lady S\'theno took the lead on the search for parts. That one will do anything to remain on solid ground, ha! \n\nShe is waiting for you on the Broken Shore.' WHERE `ID` = 45385;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Souls of the Vrykul' WHERE `ID` = 45390;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champion: Lady S\'theno' WHERE `ID` = 45391;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Dark Memento', `LogDescription` = 'Bring Velonara\'s spare hood to Death Hunter Moorgoth.', `QuestDescription` = 'The flowers were... a nice gesture.$b$b<Velonara sniffs one of the black roses.>$b$bI have a spare hood. Nothing fancy, but perhaps Moorgoth would like to have it.$b$bJust don\'t let him get his hopes up or anything. I\'m merely repaying a kindness.$b$bI would appreciate it if you kept all this between us. Giving presents to admirers falls a bit outside the dark ranger rules of conduct.' WHERE `ID` = 45392;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 45393;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 45394;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 45395;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 45396;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Harnessing Power', `LogDescription` = 'Kill Andjor Dragontamer and retrieve Rimefang\'s Harness.', `QuestDescription` = 'These fools are using the power of Rimefang\'s harness to subjugate the frost wyrms. Their leader, Andjor, sits inside on the back of the broodmother and mocks us.$b$bHe should breathe no longer.' WHERE `ID` = 45398;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Severing the Sveldrek', `LogDescription` = 'Kill and raise $1oa Sveldrek vrykul.', `QuestDescription` = 'So here\'s the order of things, as far as I\'ve been told. Mortal walks into Icecrown. Mortal is brutally defeated. Mortal gets raised as Scourge.$b$bThese fools can\'t expect to trounce in here, do whatever they want, and leave without any consequence. Time to make them truly as mindless as they act.' WHERE `ID` = 45399;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Panic at the Brewery', `LogDescription` = 'Help Almai find Brewmaster Blanche and defend Stormstout Brewery.', `QuestDescription` = 'We were not prepared for a surprise attack. I fear Brewmaster Blanche has been captured, or worse...\n\nPlease help me, Grandmaster!' WHERE `ID` = 45404;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Breaching the Sanctum', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Oculeth to start the assault.', `QuestDescription` = 'It is time. Valtrois is ready to destroy the barrier guarding the breach in the Sanctum. I will teleport you to the breach, then it falls on you to secure the area.$b$bTake these telemancy orbs. If you find you need support, use them to summon Withered.$b$bWe must strike before the enemy can ready new defenses. Let me know when you are ready and we will begin.' WHERE `ID` = 45405;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Storm\'s Fury', `LogDescription` = 'Destroy the Burning Legion forces within Shield\'s Rest.', `QuestDescription` = 'No longer do we have time to prepare, the moment of action is upon us!\n\nCome with me, little one. With you guiding my aim we shall cleanse this isle by thunder and lightning!' WHERE `ID` = 45406;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Protection: Aid of the Illidari', `LogDescription` = 'Find Kor\'vas Bloodthorn in the streets of Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = 'Thankfully, we are not quite alone in uncovering the Legion\'s plots to infiltrate the city.$B$BKor\'vas Bloodthorn of the Illidari has taken to patrolling the city streets on her own to find the source behind the recent attacks.$B$BI do not entirely trust these \'demon hunters\', but they have at least proved adept at their namesake. I suggest you find her and see what she has uncovered before the Legion strikes once more.\n\n|cFF660000Specialization: Protection Warrior|r' WHERE `ID` = 45412;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Gathering Information', `LogDescription` = 'Question citizens in the Bank of Dalaran to find out what was stolen.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Legion has sent one demon after another to try to break into the Kirin Tor vaults in the city, but we don\'t know what they\'re after.$B$BLooks like they finally made it in.$B$BWe need to find out what was taken, and quickly, before they get a chance to put whatever it is to use.$B$BProbe any survivors for information - I\'ll use my spectral sight to make sure there aren\'t still any straggling demons lurking about.' WHERE `ID` = 45413;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Confirming Suspicions', `LogDescription` = 'Find Prophet Velen in Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = 'That heart is the last remaining piece of Highlord Kruul - once one of the Legion\'s best warlords.$B$BMany years ago Kruul\'s armies nearly descended upon the Dark Portal to crush the Azerothian assault on Outland. We Illidari intercepted before he could strike.$B$BI fear that the Legion aims to use the heart to hasten Kruul\'s resurrection in the nether. We must find the Prophet Velen at once - only he can tell us for sure.' WHERE `ID` = 45414;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Between Worlds', `LogDescription` = 'Establish a portal to the Twisting Nether at the Stair of Destiny in Outland.', `QuestDescription` = 'Kruul boasts damnation, but his power has not yet fully manifested. His minions have taken his heart to hasten his rebirth in the nether.$B$BWe do not have much time.$B$BGo to the place of Kruul\'s fall at the Stair of Destiny in desolate Outland, where the link to his soul is strongest. There you must pry open the way to his realm.$B$BI must prepare for the battle to come. Good luck, champion.' WHERE `ID` = 45415;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Highlord\'s Return', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Highlord Kruul in the Twisting Nether. Speak with War Councilor Victoria to get there.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have a missive for you from Kor\'vas, as well as instructions for getting you there.$b$bI can teleport you to them to begin the fight, but you will need some Nethershards to force your way into the Twisting Nether.$b$bWhen you have enough, speak with me and you can begin.' WHERE `ID` = 45416;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Nighthold: Lord of the Shadow Council', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Gul\'dan in The Nighthold.', `QuestDescription` = 'As we speak, Gul\'dan is using the Nightwell\'s power to pull Sargeras into our world.\n\nGather your companions and fight your way to the top of The Nighthold.\n\nI will prepare Light\'s Heart and join you when the time is right.\n\nTogether, we will put an end to Gul\'dan once and for all.', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Gul\'dan' WHERE `ID` = 45417;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Eye of Aman\'Thul', `LogDescription` = 'Aid Khadgar in transporting the Eye of Aman\'Thul.', `QuestDescription` = 'The battle is won, but the war is far from over.\n\nIn order to stem the tide of demons flooding into Azeroth, we must use the Pillars of Creation to seal the Tomb of Sargeras.\n\n<Khadgar peers down at the Eye of Aman\'Thul.>\n\nThat... might be difficult to carry.\n\nPerhaps I can use the power of the Eye itself to teleport it to Dalaran. I suppose there is only one way to find out!' WHERE `ID` = 45420;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vignette: Dirge of Asgrim' WHERE `ID` = 45421;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Edict of the God-King', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat God-King Skovald in Halls of Valor on Mythic difficulty.', `QuestDescription` = 'Our scouts send troubling reports from Stormheim.$b$bGod-King Skovald has received a new directive from Gul\'dan. In response, Skovald\'s forces have stepped up their attacks.$b$bWe must know the details of Gul\'dan\'s message, $n.$b$bDespite his new orders, the god-king remains obsessed with the titan keeper Odyn. Intercept Skovald in the Halls of Valor and you may determine what his Legion masters have demanded of him.' WHERE `ID` = 45422;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Wailing Critters', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat the Budding Everliving Spore in Wailing Caverns.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'m glad you\'re here, $n.$B$BTiny wails have been heard in the caverns for some time since Naralex was awakened. At first, we suspected that some deviate critters had survived. Upon further investigation, we found them to be growing and multiplying beyond our wildest expectations. The corpse of Verdan the Everliving may have something to do with it, we\'re not sure. That\'s why we\'re sending you in.$B$BI\'ve also seen suspicious footprints leading into the caverns recently. We may not be alone, be careful.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Return to Muyani at the Wailing Caverns in Northern Barrens.' WHERE `ID` = 45423;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Grovebound', `LogDescription` = 'Return to Rensar Greathoof in the Dreamgrove.', `QuestDescription` = 'Now THAT was some good stuff right there. Now that we\'ve taken out the commander, the druids and the ancients should be safe for a while. Revenge was an added bonus.$b$bWe should get back to Rensar and tell him what we accomplished.' WHERE `ID` = 45425;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Nature\'s Advance', `LogDescription` = 'Return to Rensar Greathoof in the Dreamgrove.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, you must return to the Dreamgrove and bring the news of my attack. Tell the other druids that aggressions such as this will continue against us unless we find a way to stop the Legion.$b$bI thank you for the aid. I feel the fel energies leaving my veins, though it may take some time.' WHERE `ID` = 45426;
