UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Oh Doloria, My Sweet Doloria', `LogDescription` = 'Seek out Doloria in the Legerdermain Lounge in Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = 'What ho! We are quite the dashing pair of adventurers, aren\'t we?\n\nNow that we have secured my belongings, a new path unfolds before us. I did not journey here simply to thwart the demon invasion, no! I came here in search of my beloved, my loved, Doloria. Whilst resting between slaying of dragons, I had a dream, nay, a vision. It told me Doloria had been kidnapped and taken to a floating city in the sky!\n\nIt must be Dalaran. Quickly squire! Mount up and meet me at Dalaran\'s famous inn. Make haste!' WHERE `ID` = 45644;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Fool\'s Errand', `LogDescription` = 'Kill "Hill Bandits" to find Doloria\'s stolen "Jewelry" and buy her "release".', `QuestDescription` = 'Oh yea sure, I\'m, um, held here against my, you know, will, or something.\n\nLook bud, between you and me old Max here has no chance, but his heart is in the right place. I keep trying to run away and hide but he keeps finding me! I just don\'t have it in me to upset him with the truth.\n\nI\'ve got an idea. Why don\'t you go kill some of those really big two headed "Hill Bandits" for me. Let\'s say they stole some jewelery from me, and you can use it to buy my freedom.\n\nTake your time, don\'t get hurt. Much.' WHERE `ID` = 45645;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Mission: Search and Rescue', `LogDescription` = 'Rescue 8 squads of Captured Warriors.', `QuestDescription` = 'I will make these naga pay for their audacity. \n\nThey and their skrog lackeys captured our warriors while we were fighting the Legion. They have no honor!\n\nWe must rescue our fallen soldiers before they are sold as slaves, or worse...' WHERE `ID` = 45647;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Missing in Action: Lord Darius Crowley', `LogDescription` = 'Search for Lord Darius Crowley.', `QuestDescription` = 'Are you familiar with Lord Darius Crowley? He is the worthy Gilnean warrior who was leading our forces against the Felrage naga nearby. \n\nUnfortunately the naga captured many of our soldiers during a recent skirmish. Lord Darius went after them and has not returned. I fear something terrible has happened to him.\n\nPlease try to find him!' WHERE `ID` = 45648;
