UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Folly of Levia Laurance', `LogDescription` = 'Ask around the city for information on Levia Laurance.', `QuestDescription` = 'Levia Laurance was once a member of the Kirin Tor, long ago, and a good friend. Dabbling in shadow magic got her banned from the city, but she knows the streets too well to keep her out for good.\n\nLevia has disappeared, and I\'m gravely concerned. Her work may have attracted the attention of the Legion. It has before. It would be very dangerous for all of us if her knowledge fell into their hands.\n\nShe was last seen at the Militant Mystic. Ask around there and see if you can pick up her trail.' WHERE `ID` = 45915;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Acolyte Imperiled', `LogDescription` = 'Help Ritssyn investigate Levia\'s ritual.', `QuestDescription` = 'Truthfully, the Council knows little of Agatha, but she is more than just your average succubus. She has many allies within the sayaad, and is known to command armies of imps that swarm and overwhelm her foes.\n\nTo seek her out is folly, but Ritssyn Flamescowl repays his debts.\n\nCome, let us examine what manner of fel powers this little mage of yours was stumbling her way through...' WHERE `ID` = 45916;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Following the Scent', `LogDescription` = 'Follow Fhambar to Levia\'s location.', `QuestDescription` = 'You will have to continue through the portal without me, $c. I have assisted you in locating your mage\'s whereabouts, so I consider my debt to Modera paid.\n\nHowever, I will lend you one of my felhounds to help track this mage down. If she is as powerful as Modera says, then it would be in everyone\'s best interest that Agatha not be allowed to keep her.\n\nBest of luck, $c, and try to bring Fhambar back in one piece.' WHERE `ID` = 45917;
