UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Cutting off the Heads', `LogDescription` = 'Slay the risen squad leaders in Bradensbrook.', `QuestDescription` = 'Erdris Thorn was a key commander of Ravencrest\'s forces. To hear him confusing us for the Legion fills me with a great sadness. He will be a difficult foe to defeat.\n\nWe must stop his squad leaders from forming up for a focused assault on Bradensbrook. Defeating them should delay his forces long enough for us to find and deal with him. Let us begin our grim task.' WHERE `ID` = 46106;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Source of the Corruption', `LogDescription` = 'Find the source of the corruption at Heroes\' Rest and end it.', `QuestDescription` = 'There was something wrong with those three, they had a fel taint about them that was... unsettling. I believe they were somehow woken later than the other risen. Curse the Legion and their meddling!\n\nThe reinforcements are streaming out of Black Rook Hold from Heroes\' Rest. We must make our way there and see if we can stop the source of these new troops.' WHERE `ID` = 46107;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Knowledge is Power', `LogDescription` = 'Provide Order Resources to unlock artifact knowledge.', `QuestDescription` = 'Throughout our campaign on the Broken Isles, you have infused your ancient artifact with power. But as the Legion invasion intensifies, it becomes crucial to unlock more of your weapon\'s potential.\n\nThere is a time for slow, steady progress. But today, we must hasten our efforts.\n\nBy devoting our order\'s resources to studying the weapon\'s history, I believe we can rapidly enhance the value of the power you apply to the artifact.\n\nShall we begin, $ct?' WHERE `ID` = 46108;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Stand!' WHERE `ID` = 46109;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Battle for Stormheim', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Lord Commander Alexius in Stormheim.', `QuestDescription` = 'Your efforts have destroyed the Legion\'s forces upon Shield\'s Rest, yet they continue to press their assault.\n\nThere is only one way to end this - you must venture into the midst of our foe, find their commander, and remove his vile head!' WHERE `ID` = 46110;
