UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Knowledge is Power', `LogDescription` = 'Provide Order Resources to unlock artifact knowledge.', `QuestDescription` = 'Throughout our campaign on the Broken Isles, you have infused your ancient artifact with power. But as the Legion invasion intensifies, it becomes crucial to unlock more of your weapon\'s potential.\n\nThere is a time for slow, steady progress. But today, we must move with the wind at our backs.\n\nBy devoting our order\'s resources to studying the weapon\'s history, I believe we can rapidly enhance the value of the power you apply to the artifact.\n\nShall we begin, $ct?' WHERE `ID` = 46147;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Furthering Knowledge', `LogDescription` = 'Deliver Order Resources to complete a crash course in artifact knowledge.', `QuestDescription` = 'We\'ve got the skinny on a bit of the artifact power already and I am working an angle to capitalize on it. \n\nWe\'ve been extorting a group of scribes to put together notes for you, yet they are holding out for a few more resources before they deliver. \n\nThe good news is that we can squeeze them for a few more courses, but after that it will be back to doing our own research.' WHERE `ID` = 46148;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Furthering Knowledge', `LogDescription` = 'Deliver Order Resources to complete a crash course in artifact knowledge.', `QuestDescription` = 'I am amazed by what we have learned so far. I believe I can prepare for you some notes based on our initial research to get you caught up quickly.\n\nIt will take just a few more resources to prepare the notes properly.\n\nThese steps we take now should provide a boost to our knowledge and we can delve even deeper into the hidden potential of these weapons.' WHERE `ID` = 46149;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Furthering Knowledge', `LogDescription` = 'Deliver Order Resources to complete a crash course in artifact knowledge.', `QuestDescription` = 'The amount of power in these artifacts is incredible and we have only scratched the surface. \n\nOur researchers have been busy preparing notes for you and with a few more resources I am sure they can prepare something to boost your artifact knowledge. \n\nThis is only the first step, with more resources we should be able to help you catch up even more.' WHERE `ID` = 46150;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Furthering Knowledge', `LogDescription` = 'Deliver Order Resources to complete a crash course in artifact knowledge.', `QuestDescription` = 'I am surprised and awed each day I delve deeper into the history of these weapons.  \n\nOur researcher has been going extremely well and we have been busy preparing notes for you. With a few more resources I am sure we can prepare something to boost your artifact knowledge a little. \n\nRemember though, this is only a first step. These weapons have been around longer than most recorded history so much deeper knowledge will take time.' WHERE `ID` = 46151;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Furthering Knowledge', `LogDescription` = 'Deliver Order Resources to complete a crash course in artifact knowledge.', `QuestDescription` = 'Through pain and blood we have cut through the initial layers of research. \n\nWe have been busy preparing notes for you and with a few more resources we can get you something to boost your artifact knowledge. \n\nThis is only the first step, more resources will be required to catch you up further.' WHERE `ID` = 46152;
