UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Foiling the Legion\'s Jailbreak', `LogDescription` = 'Find High Inquisitor Raalgar before the Legion frees him.', `QuestDescription` = 'High Inquisitor Raalgar has some connection to the fel here on Argus that makes him unkillable. Long ago, the naaru imprisoned him on the Arcatraz. $b$bWhen the forces of Kael\'thas Sunstrider attacked the citadel, we were forced to flee on the Exodar.$b$bSome Legion prisoners escaped the Arcatraz when last the Legion invaded Azeroth, but Raalgar did not. Stop them from freeing him and I will study the source of his immortality so it can be broken. $b$bI can get you close. The rest is up to you.' WHERE `ID` = 47134;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'For Their Own Good' WHERE `ID` = 47135;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Champions of Legionfall', `LogDescription` = 'Return to your class order hall and recruit a new champion.', `QuestDescription` = 'The battle to reclaim the Broken Shore is straining our resources. We cannot afford to relent, lest the Legion undo all that we have accomplished.\n\nThe members of your order have given much, but more is needed.\n\nRally your champions and do what you must to bolster their ranks. There may be untapped power in this land that will turn the tide of war in our favor.' WHERE `ID` = 47137;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Mark of the Sentinax', `LogDescription` = 'Collect $1oa Marks of the Sentinax.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Sentinax rains down terror upon the Broken Shore, unleashing hordes of demons that menace our forces. The fiends seek to stop us from taking the Tomb.\n\nThey will fail.\n\nLure out the strongest among their vile ranks. Slay them and seize the marks they bear. Make the Legion fear our strength!' WHERE `ID` = 47139;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'First Win of the Day (BG Brawl)' WHERE `ID` = 47144;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Something Different', `LogDescription` = 'Win a PvP Brawl.', `QuestDescription` = 'Even the most bloodthirsty combatants eventually grow weary and turn their backs to the unending struggle of war. They seek a new way to test their mettle and destroy their enemies. \n\nJoin the Brawl in progress and fight your opponents in a limited time event that tosses traditional rules aside.' WHERE `ID` = 47148;
