UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Sources of Darkness', `LogDescription` = 'Deactivate 5 Void Harvesters.', `QuestDescription` = 'I think I understand what he was trying to show us, $n.$b$bI feel a surge of power building ahead. They must be cultivating the Void, calling it here.$b$bWe need to stop them before they plunge this entire city into shadow. Find the source and cut it off by any means necessary.$b$bLocus-Walker and I have unfinished business to attend to.' WHERE `ID` = 47217;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Shadowguard Incursion', `LogDescription` = 'Slay 15 Shadowguard Ethereals.', `QuestDescription` = 'As you have surely gathered by now, a certain subset of my people have tragically succumbed to the call of the Void.$b$bI had hoped to find more who possess the necessary strength of mind. I am disappointed to find such an utter lack of resistance.$b$bIt cannot be helped. To advance your cause, and mine, we will need to eradicate these weak-willed beings.' WHERE `ID` = 47218;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Vessel Made Ready', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Nhal\'athoth and collect his heart.', `QuestDescription` = 'After some consideration, I have decided to allow Alleria another opportunity to pursue her destiny.$b$bI suppose you want to know what that means, mortal.$b$b<Locus-Walker laughs.>$b$bMeet us deep in the Shadowguard camp ahead- my brethren are preparing a summons that will provide adequate energy for Windrunner to begin again.$b$bWitness what happens when you harness the Void\'s power.', `PortraitGiverText` = 'Though only a demi-god, Nhal\'athoth\'s presence haunts the dark corners of Mac\'Aree.', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Nhal\'athoth' WHERE `ID` = 47219;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Beacon in the Dark', `LogDescription` = 'Take the Remnant of Nhal\'athoth to Velen on the Vindicaar.', `QuestDescription` = 'That was... an intense experience.$b$b<Alleria rubs her forehead.>$b$bIt is difficult to focus. I need you to return to Velen. Give him this.$b$b<She places something cold and dense in your palm.>$b$bI feel as though he should have it, though I am not sure why.$b$bTell him all that we have learned. I am sure Romuul will have been watching our progress. With any luck, a beacon is already headed our way.' WHERE `ID` = 47220;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Hand of Fate', `LogDescription` = 'Meet your escort to the Exodar at Stormwind Harbor.', `QuestDescription` = '$p,\n\nWe have won many battles against the Burning Legion, but it is time to end this war once and for all. \n\nFinal preparations have begun to depart for Argus.\n\nMake haste to Stormwind Harbor. A ship awaits you there to grant you and your allies passage to Azuremyst.' WHERE `ID` = 47221;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Two If By Sea', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Vereesa Windrunner to set sail for the Exodar.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Tomb of Sargeras was only the beginning. If we do not destroy the Legion utterly, they will return even stronger.\n\nWe will travel to Azuremyst by sea to avoid drawing unnecessary attention. The less time the Legion has to react to our assault, the better.\n\nJust say the word when you are ready to depart.' WHERE `ID` = 47222;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Light\'s Exodus', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Prophet Velen in the Vault of Lights in the Exodar.', `QuestDescription` = 'Prophet Velen and the others have gathered within the Vault of Lights below. There is an entrance just down this path.\n\nWe should find the Prophet at once so that we do not stall the invasion.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Meet Prophet Velen in the Vault of Lights.' WHERE `ID` = 47223;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Vindicaar', `LogDescription` = 'Board the Vindicaar.', `QuestDescription` = 'Everything is prepared for our assault. We need only establish the beacon to transport us to the vessel.\n\nOnce the beacon arrives, place your hand upon its surface to board the Vindicaar, the instrument of our retribution.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Meet Prophet Velen on the Vindicaar.' WHERE `ID` = 47224;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Seat of the Triumvirate', `LogDescription` = 'Seek the Crest of Knowledge.', `QuestDescription` = 'Even with the Sigil of Awakening in hand, the Crown cannot save us until it is whole.$b$bThat is why we must enter the Seat of the Triumvirate, even knowing that L\'ura awaits us there.$b$bThis is a dire task, one that I would not ask if it were not completely necessary.$b$bWe will descend together. Come.' WHERE `ID` = 47238;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Interesting Times', `LogDescription` = 'Meet with Historian Ju\'Pa in the Valley of Spirits of Orgrimmar.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, I don\'t mean to alarm you, but we may be experiencing some... temporal disturbances.\n\nHave you ever heard the phrase \'I hope the past doesn\'t come back to haunt you?\'\n\nCome visit me in the Valley of Spirits and we can speak more.' WHERE `ID` = 47251;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Interesting Times', `LogDescription` = 'Meet with Historian Llore in the Royal Library of Stormwind.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, I don\'t mean to alarm you, but we may be experiencing some... temporal disturbances.\n\nHave you ever heard the phrase \'I hope the past doesn\'t come back to haunt you?\'\n\nCome visit me in the Stormwind Royal Library and we can speak more.' WHERE `ID` = 47252;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Originals', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Lord Kazzak in Blasted Lands, Azuregos in Azshara, and the Dragon of Nightmare at one of the portals to the Emerald Dream.', `QuestDescription` = 'Long ago, great terrors walked our lands, and drove even the smallest to flights of heroism.\n\nI speak, of course, about Lord Kazzak, Azueregos, and the Dragons of Nightmare.\n\nLegends have it that so sought after were their treasures, that armies would camp overnight to hunt them down.\n\nWe have felt disturbances in the timeways, coincidentally located where these giants once roamed. \n\nWould you mind investigating for us? Strange things happen during this time of year.' WHERE `ID` = 47253;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Originals', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Lord Kazzak in Blasted Lands, Azuregos in Azshara, and the Dragon of Nightmare at one of the portals to the Emerald Dream.', `QuestDescription` = 'Long ago, great terrors walked our lands, and drove even the smallest to flights of heroism.\n\nI speak, of course, about Lord Kazzak, Azueregos, and the Dragons of Nightmare.\n\nLegends have it that so sought after were their treasures, that armies would camp overnight to hunt them down.\n\nWe have felt disturbances in the timeways, coincidentally located where these giants once roamed. \n\nWould you mind investigating for us? Strange things happen during this time of year.' WHERE `ID` = 47254;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47255;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47256;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Vindicaar Matrix Core', `LogDescription` = 'Link Light\'s Judgment into the Vindicaar Matrix Core.', `QuestDescription` = 'Much has happened on Argus that concerns me but none moreso than Xe\'ra\'s fate. I wonder sometimes if we are doing the right thing? $b$bBut we must carry on. I can rig the Matrix Core that powers the Vindicaar to allow you to call on the power of our guns when you have need of them on the planet. $b$bGo to the Matrix Core in the room at the heart of our ship. Once linked, whatever powers the core has installed now and in the future will be at your disposal.' WHERE `ID` = 47287;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'World Event Dungeon - Hummel' WHERE `ID` = 47290;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Whispers of a Frightened World', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Magni in Sholazar Basin and hear the warning.', `QuestDescription` = 'Champion, Magni needs your help!$b$bThe Speaker has a message for you, perhaps from Azeroth herself. He seems to be having trouble understanding her, but I\'m sure he can explain everything better.$b$bHe said he was in Sholazar Basin, in Northrend. He should be contacting you shortly.' WHERE `ID` = 47330;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47331;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Shadow of the Triumvirate', `LogDescription` = 'Return to the Vindicaar.', `QuestDescription` = 'Talgath\'s words carry more gravity than I think he knew. In an attempt to hurt me one final time, he has given us the answer.$b$bThe Crest of Knowledge is hidden away in the Seat of the Triumvirate, and it is not unguarded.$b$bIf my suspicions are correct, we may be facing a greater threat than any of us dared imagine.$b$bA dark naaru.$b$bLet us return to the Vindicaar. We will plan our next steps there.' WHERE `ID` = 47416;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'FLAG - First Chromie Saved' WHERE `ID` = 47424;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Moonkin Monitoring', `LogDescription` = 'Observe the nearby dancing, moonfiring, and napping Moonkin Hatchlings and see what you can learn.', `QuestDescription` = '<Makkaw motions for you to observe the other moonkin in the area.>' WHERE `ID` = 47430;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Gathering Light', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Turalyon in the Krokul Hovel.', `QuestDescription` = 'Alleria and I long for more time with our son, but we cannot afford to wait any longer, $n. We must strike now.$b$bThe Army of the Light is scattered, but not defeated. Any survivors should have stayed near the crash site of the Xenedar. If there is any hope of victory, we must rally them and rescue Xe\'ra.$b$bWith the pit lords dealt with, we should have a safer route to the Xenedar. Meet me in the krokul hovel as soon as you can.' WHERE `ID` = 47431;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vindictive Combatant\'s Leather Armor' WHERE `ID` = 47444;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vindictive Combatant\'s Leather Armor' WHERE `ID` = 47446;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Calming the Void' WHERE `ID` = 47456;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47461;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47462;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47463;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47464;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47465;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47466;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Sizing Up The Opposition', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Turalyon.', `QuestDescription` = 'Turalyon was no doubt hoping for better news, but I fear I cannot provide it. Attempting to drive into the heart of the Legion now would cost us everything.\n\nThere must be another way. I do not know what it is, but I trust that we will find it.\n\nBest not keep Turalyon waiting. We must move forward.' WHERE `ID` = 47473;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Bunker Buster' WHERE `ID` = 47496;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Khazaduum' WHERE `ID` = 47507;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fire At Will', `LogDescription` = 'Enter a Lightforged Battery and slay $1oa Frenzied Plaguewings.', `QuestDescription` = 'Look out there, the wings of the bats fill the sky. We must offer what ranged support we can, but our hands are full here.$b$bIt looks like the Legion has not yet destroyed all of the artillery batteries. If you can get to one, you should be able to show those flying fiends the Light.' WHERE `ID` = 47508;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Disturbance Detected: Black Temple', `LogDescription` = 'Relive the assault on the Black Temple.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, right on time, as always.\n\nGood news first, because they\'re happening at the same time for me anyway. Thanks to the various timewarped objects past and future you discovered, we\'ve figured out how to detect when a new one turns up.  \n\nThe bad news is, we know our technique works because something has changed in the Black Temple, and it\'s wreaking havoc across the timescape! We need you to ensure the fateful raid turns out exactly like it did before, and to remove the source of this disturbance.' WHERE `ID` = 47523;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Bringing the Big Guns', `LogDescription` = 'Locate and secure Light\'s Judgment.', `QuestDescription` = 'Light\'s Judgment has a security feature to prevent it from falling into enemy hands. We can trigger its recall mechanism, which will teleport it back to a vessel.$b$bWith the Xenedar out of commission, the gun should recall to your ship instead. You can make good use of its firepower.$b$bThe process takes time, though, and will likely attract the Legion\'s attention. Be on your guard.' WHERE `ID` = 47526;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Best Prevention', `LogDescription` = 'Slay $1oa attackers in the Shattered Fields.', `QuestDescription` = 'If you\'ve brought the High Exarch back to us, you are a welcome ally indeed.$b$bMore is needed of you. You see our soldiers out there, fighting against all odds? Defend them. Slay the enemy.$b$bStrong words for a priest, perhaps, but every dead man\'ari is one less blade at our throats.$b$bShow them that the Light protects its chosen even as it scorches the unfaithful.$b$bWhen you are finished, seek out Y\'mera. She will have fewer troops, and more need of your abilities.' WHERE `ID` = 47541;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Siegemaster Voraan' WHERE `ID` = 47542;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Day That Chromie Dies', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Chromie, then travel to the future to find out how she dies.', `QuestDescription` = 'Oh, $n! I was just thinking about you! Talk about being at the right time in the right place!\n\nI was just reviewing some aberrations in the timeways, when I discovered something... unexpected. Something not-so-great.\n\nI\'m going to die in the near future. Bad times.\n\nI was just about to jump ahead and see if I can figure out why, how, who... but I\'d feel better with |5$r like you by my side. Care to join me?' WHERE `ID` = 47543;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Rewind', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Chromie again, then travel to the future and gather information from the other Wyrmrest emissaries.', `QuestDescription` = 'Now we know when the attack happens, and vaguely where it\'s coming from. Progress! All we need to do now is to find out more details and stop that attack!\n\nLet me know when you\'re ready to try again.' WHERE `ID` = 47545;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Many Advantages of Being a Time Dragon', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Chromie a third time, then travel to the future and attempt to save her again.', `QuestDescription` = 'Well, unfortunately for... whomever is fixated on blasting me into oblivion, I am a fairly skilled master of the timeways! We have the advantage of trying that again, and again, and again, until I\'m not dead anymore.\n\nWe\'re going to need a little more than a few seconds to stop this attack. How does four hours sound?' WHERE `ID` = 47550;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Lessons of Fire and Pain' WHERE `ID` = 47551;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Mistress Il\'thendra' WHERE `ID` = 47552;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Intercepting the Legion\'s Plans', `LogDescription` = 'Search the battlefield for Legion troops and kill them to get their Enigmatic Legion Orders. Retrieve the Army of the Light Code Book to decipher the orders.', `QuestDescription` = 'Our scout Skara writes in the missive that she learned of a major Legion initiative. She was after two encoded orders held by Legion troops near us to get the details and this must be when she was killed. The Legion splits their messages into encoded parts so that we cannot read them. $b$bSkara also writes that her partner Brae, a codebreaker, was slain trying to reach our lines with a code book that we will need to translate the Legion\'s orders. It is vital you find the orders and that code book!' WHERE `ID` = 47554;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Smoldering Chronoshard', `LogDescription` = 'Bring the Smoldering Chronoshard to Wyrmrest to unlock a time portal.', `QuestDescription` = 'This shard of crystal is hot to the touch. The void creature that carried it wasn\'t a wielder of flame in any noticeable way, so perhaps the chronoshard is related to fire in some other way.' WHERE `ID` = 47557;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fel-Touched Chronoshard', `LogDescription` = 'Bring the Fel-Touched Chronoshard to Wyrmrest to unlock a time portal.', `QuestDescription` = 'This shard of crystal is scarred with deep rivets of green, malevolent energy. Being held by a dreadlord will do that to you.' WHERE `ID` = 47558;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Gleaming Chronoshard', `LogDescription` = 'Bring the Gleaming Chronoshard to Wyrmrest to unlock a time portal.', `QuestDescription` = 'This shard of crystal glitters with a metallic sheen. Based on Chromie\'s reaction, it may be used to connect you to another time and place.' WHERE `ID` = 47559;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Frozen Chronoshard', `LogDescription` = 'Bring the Frozen Chronoshard to Wyrmrest to unlock a time portal.', `QuestDescription` = 'This shard of crystal is encased in a thin, frigid layer of permafrost. It still has that distinctive lich smell to it.' WHERE `ID` = 47560;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Blistermaw' WHERE `ID` = 47561;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Spirits of the Fallen' WHERE `ID` = 47563;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Gar\'zoth' WHERE `ID` = 47566;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Righteous Fury', `LogDescription` = 'Destroy $1oa Legion Devastators.', `QuestDescription` = 'The devastators bombarding our forces prevent us from advancing any further. I can only protect us from their blasts for so long.$B$BChampion, you must pierce their lines and remove the barriers protecting the devastators.$B$BIf you can destroy the anchors that maintain the shields, I can cleanse them from afar.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Meet Prophet Velen at the Crown of Destruction.' WHERE `ID` = 47589;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tier 3 Mob Daily Bonus (DNT)' WHERE `ID` = 47590;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Wanna Buy a Lamp?', `LogDescription` = 'Purchase the Dubious Lamp from Griftah.', `QuestDescription` = 'Ey dere, wanna buy a lamp? You be not regrettin\' it.' WHERE `ID` = 47591;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Shine Bright Like a Diamond', `LogDescription` = 'Purchase a Certified Organic Lamp Shining Kit from Griftah and use it to shine the Grimy Lamp.', `QuestDescription` = 'Oh, I be sorry. Dat lamp look like it could use some shinin\'. I happen to have just da ting.' WHERE `ID` = 47592;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'I\'ll Take Those, Thanks!', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain 10,000 Coins of Air for Griftah.', `QuestDescription` = 'These coins, dey be vanishin\' inta air ya say? Dat be soundin\' perfect, as I have jus the fella ta give dem to.' WHERE `ID` = 47594;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'I Don\'t Need Them, But I\'ll Take Them', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 10,000 Coins of Air for Griftah.', `QuestDescription` = 'If you wanna collect more, Griftah not gonna argue with dat. Dat bein\' said, I don\'t need dem as much anymore, so I be givin\' you less for dem.', `AreaDescription` = 'Collect 9999 Coins of Air for Griftah.' WHERE `ID` = 47595;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Mysterious, Magnificent Al\'Abas', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Al\'Abas.', `QuestDescription` = 'I see you, puny mortal! I appreciate your concern for my lamp!' WHERE `ID` = 47603;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'In the Land of Magic', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Al\'Abas... again.', `QuestDescription` = 'I think I see the problem. Your puny eyes are too weak to detect the mana-infused finery that these elves have spread throughout the land. They\'ve been wearing jewelry the entire time, and you simply couldn\'t see it.\n\nI propose a partnership, my newly minted associate. My lamp currently suffers from an embarrassing lack of magic and could always use more beautiful decorations. I propose a trade. I shall pierce this sinister veil, and you shall give me the spoils of your theft.' WHERE `ID` = 47604;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Coins of Air', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Al\'Abas yet again.', `QuestDescription` = 'I would be much interested in these magical trinkets that reside in the pockets of the denizens of this land, and humbly offer my services in helping you acquire them, $n. \n\nHowever, I sadly cannot pay you in the coin of this realm. What I can offer are ephemera - coins of purest air. They\'re better than nothing, though!\n\nCarry my lamp with you. Drop the treasures you steal within, and I will grant you these coins. Perhaps the former owner of my lamp would have a use for them.' WHERE `ID` = 47605;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Loyalty Is Its Own Reward', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain a thousand Coins of Air.', `QuestDescription` = 'I offer you a challenge, mortal. Obtain a thousand of my coins, and I believe that I can empower my lamp and the vision within.' WHERE `ID` = 47606;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'High Fash-Djinn', `LogDescription` = 'Find rare treasures in the pockets of the denizens of the Broken Isles.', `QuestDescription` = 'With my newly empowered lamp, I sense further, more valuable trinkets in the pockets of these elves and demons. Fetch them for me!' WHERE `ID` = 47607;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Wild Gladiator\'s Chain Armor' WHERE `ID` = 47609;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Golden King Plate' WHERE `ID` = 47610;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Betrayer Regalia' WHERE `ID` = 47611;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Windfury Set' WHERE `ID` = 47612;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Silent Assassin Armor' WHERE `ID` = 47613;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Light Regalia' WHERE `ID` = 47614;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Holy Warrior Plate' WHERE `ID` = 47615;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Regal Lord Armor' WHERE `ID` = 47616;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Elemental Triad Regalia' WHERE `ID` = 47617;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Howling Beast Set' WHERE `ID` = 47618;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Cycle Armor' WHERE `ID` = 47619;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Lich Lord Plate' WHERE `ID` = 47620;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Bury It' WHERE `ID` = 47624;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Ritual We Share' WHERE `ID` = 47625;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Vengeance', `LogDescription` = 'Destroy the siege weapon at the Crown of Destruction.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Army of the Light will not have fallen in vain.$B$BOur forces will assault the main encampment while we destroy their siege weapon.$B$BThis will be but the beginning of our vengeance.' WHERE `ID` = 47627;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Signs of Resistance', `LogDescription` = 'Search for signs of resistance.', `QuestDescription` = 'Our forces sustained heavy losses defending the Vindicaar, $n. We require allies.$B$BThe Army of the Light was known to take in survivors of the Legion\'s crusade to bolster their ranks. We must do the same.$B$BI sense the presence of the Legion slaves you freed nearby. I suspect that they have carved out a resistance against their masters.$B$BI would appreciate your company, $p.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Meet Prophet Velen outside the Krokul Hovel.' WHERE `ID` = 47641;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Soul Crystal', `LogDescription` = 'Seek out the lich hidden within the Ruby Dragonshrine\'s tree.', `QuestDescription` = '<The three shards combine neatly into a large crystal. Once reassembled, the image of a powerful lich appears above the crystal\'s surface.>\n\n<The lich speaks:>\n\nKeep the Ruby Shrinewardens occupied. I shall carry out our master\'s attack from within the great tree itself.' WHERE `ID` = 47642;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Ancients\' Wisdom', `LogDescription` = 'Seek out the satyr hidden in the Emerald Dragonshrine.', `QuestDescription` = 'The three ancients left three clues:\n\n"...the great nightmare..."\n\n"...by the water..."\n\n"...within the dragon\'s palm..."\n\nPerhaps Chromie\'s attacker lies in the place the ancients describe?' WHERE `ID` = 47643;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Demonic Corestone', `LogDescription` = 'Uncover the dreadlord hidden near the entrance to the Obsidian Dragonshrine\'s cave.', `QuestDescription` = '<Deep within the demonic corestone, the image of a dreadlord speaks ominously:>\n\nYes, master. It shall be done, at the exact time that you specified. The bronze dragon will see nothing. One shot from outside the Obsidian Dragonshrine is all I require.' WHERE `ID` = 47644;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Voidcallers\' Scroll', `LogDescription` = 'Seek out the creature of void hidden above the Azure Dragonshrine.', `QuestDescription` = '<The scroll pieces combine to form a tattered, but readable message:>\n\nThe time is nigh. The invocation will take place above the azure shrine. The void will swallow the bronze dragon. Our master has spoken, and we obey.' WHERE `ID` = 47645;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Rope Around' WHERE `ID` = 47646;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Light Mother', `LogDescription` = 'Find Xe\'ra within the Xenedar.', `QuestDescription` = 'We must know for sure whether the Light Mother survived, $n.$b$bXe\'ra was weakened by sending her heart to Azeroth, but she is the prime naaru. She is the Light, and she cannot fade.$b$bLet\'s head into the Xenedar and look for her. Light willing, she will return to guide us once more.' WHERE `ID` = 47652;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Light\'s Return', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Turalyon to return to the Vindicaar.', `QuestDescription` = 'Xe\'ra has been saved! We have won an important victory here.$b$bThe Light Mother should be back on the Vindicaar. No doubt she will want to speak with you. There is so much to explain...$b$bRomuul should be able to teleport us back to the ship now. Let me know when you are ready.' WHERE `ID` = 47653;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Seat of the Triumvirate: The Crest of Knowledge', `LogDescription` = 'Slay L\'ura and retrieve the Crest of Knowledge.', `QuestDescription` = 'We have all that we need now, $n.$b$bAlleria Windrunner awaits your arrival at the Seat of the Triumvirate.$b$bDo not go alone, my friend. You will need allies to recover the Crest of Knowledge... and endure what L\'ura has become.$b$bI will prepare the Vindicaar and await your return. Light be with you in that dark place.' WHERE `ID` = 47654;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DNT' WHERE `ID` = 47658;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DNT' WHERE `ID` = 47661;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Timely Summons from Shattrath', `LogDescription` = 'Meet with Vormu in Shattrath.', `QuestDescription` = 'The blazing star holds a peculiar alignment this cycle, calling out across the heavens. Seek out the sage Vormu in Shattrath City, and lend her your aid.' WHERE `ID` = 47663;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Gatekeeper\'s Challenge: Cunning', `LogDescription` = 'Collect a Fragment of Acuity, Wit, and Guile and combine them into a Mark of Cunning.', `QuestDescription` = 'Archimonde expected greatness from his pupils. Only the most imaginative minds, the most adroit of intellects, could ever truly fathom the deepest reaches of our magic.$b$bI doubt you can relate.$b$bThe path to the left will take you to a set of three statues. Use them to collect a Mark of Cunning.$b$bTo preserve the integrity of this trial, I will not be able to provide hints. If you do, by some miracle, happen to succeed, I will formally recognize your... brilliance.' WHERE `ID` = 47685;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Not-So-Humble Beginnings', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Archmage Y\'mera at the Conservatory of the Arcane.', `QuestDescription` = 'Now we may begin our search for the Crown of the Triumvirate. We will start with the fragment Archimonde carried: the Sigil of Awakening.$b$bTo the east and north you will find all that remains of the greatest school of magic on Argus. It was there that Archimonde gained his mastery of the arcane. I can think of no other place he would stow his treasures.$b$bIt will be guarded, no doubt. We will leverage the expertise of Fareeya\'s forces here to follow this trail.' WHERE `ID` = 47686;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Gatekeeper\'s Challenge: Mastery', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Grand Vizier Jarasum, Arc-Consul Velara, and High Wakener Aargon.', `QuestDescription` = 'Archimonde was an individual consumed by the pursuit of power. Only those who could match his lust would fare well under his tutelage.$b$bYou will fight what remains of Archimonde\'s greatest pupils. These three once held such power in their own disciplines that the Conservatory remembers them now.$b$bTheir echoes will try to kill you.$b$bBest all three with all your limbs intact and I will recognize your strength.' WHERE `ID` = 47687;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Invasive Species', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 30 Partially Digested Arcana.', `QuestDescription` = 'We should seek out an alternate source of energy just in case I am wrong about the conduits.$b$bLuckily enough, I think I know where we can find one.$b$bThe panthara native to Argus are solitary creatures, but it seems whatever magic the Wakeners possessed has drawn them here in great numbers.$b$bThis is no time to be gentle with the environment--panthara devour energy to survive.$b$bSlay them and see if you cannot reclaim some of the power they have consumed.' WHERE `ID` = 47688;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Gatekeeper\'s Challenge: Tenacity', `LogDescription` = 'Overcome the Trial of Tenacity.', `QuestDescription` = 'My master Archimonde was not known for his willingness to suffer indecision.$b$bHe preferred to teach by rewarding frustration with more frustration-- punishment with more punishment. Absolute conviction was required to succeed under him.$b$bAt the opposite end of the Conservatory you will find a large structure. Once inside, your goal is to overcome all the obstacles placed before you.$b$b Emerge unscathed and I will be forced to consider your will strong enough to proceed.' WHERE `ID` = 47689;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Defiler\'s Legacy', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Archimonde and retrieve the Sigil of Awakening.', `QuestDescription` = 'It seems you are not so easily deterred. Very well.$b$bYour deeds qualify you to seek the Sigil. To be clear, I am only permitting you to move on. This does not guarantee your success.$b$bThe greatest of your challenges lies before you.$b$bYou must go to the Praetorium and face Archimonde himself. Only by defeating the master of the Conservatory will you be worthy of the Sigil.$b$bFew have overcome this obstacle. I hope he does not make too much of a mess of you.', `PortraitGiverText` = 'Archimonde did not know he would become the Defiler, but his pursuit of power did not start when Sargeras arrived.', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Archimonde' WHERE `ID` = 47690;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Non-Prophet Organization', `LogDescription` = 'Locate Velen.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have complete faith that Velen is nearby. We would know if he had been captured.$b$bAll the same, we must not delay. The Legion has a vested interest in finding him after all he has done to resist them. I shudder to think what they might do, given the chance.$b$bThat is why I am going with you.$b$bWe will find Velen and help him track down the Crest of Knowledge. We must have faith in his mission or all will be lost.' WHERE `ID` = 47691;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DNT' WHERE `ID` = 47699;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'DNT' WHERE `ID` = 47700;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Behind Legion Lines' WHERE `ID` = 47705;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Melting Down' WHERE `ID` = 47707;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Great Gnomeregan Race', `LogDescription` = 'Race to Booty Bay.', `QuestDescription` = 'Ready for the big race today, $n?\n\nEvery year, gnomes from near and far gather to run all the way from Gnomeregan to Booty Bay!\n\nIt reminds us that no goal is too tall, even for us!  Whether you run fast or slow, alone or with friends, you\'ll make it as long as you keep trying! So make sure to stretch, then get out there and show the world what we gnomes are made of!' WHERE `ID` = 47709;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Devastator' WHERE `ID` = 47712;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47715;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Eternal Vengeance' WHERE `ID` = 47720;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Besieged' WHERE `ID` = 47724;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Aegwynn\'s Path', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 4 Fragment of the Guardian\'s Seal from the Maiden of Vigilance in the Tomb of Sargeras on Normal Difficulty.', `QuestDescription` = 'As we sealed the tomb, I entrusted the final piece of Sargeras\' prison to the Maiden of Vigilance. If you had it you could move freely throughout the tomb, but I know not what became of the keeper and fear the worst.' WHERE `ID` = 47725;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Aegwynn\'s Path', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 4 Fragment of the Guardian\'s Seal from the Maiden of Vigilance in the Tomb of Sargeras on Heroic Difficulty.', `QuestDescription` = 'As we sealed the tomb, I entrusted the final piece of Sargeras\' prison to the Maiden of Vigilance. If you had it you could move freely throughout the tomb, but I know not what became of the keeper and fear the worst.' WHERE `ID` = 47726;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Aegwynn\'s Path', `LogDescription` = 'Collect 4 Fragment of the Guardian\'s Seal from the Maiden of Vigilance in the Tomb of Sargeras on Mythic Difficulty.', `QuestDescription` = 'As we sealed the tomb, I entrusted the final piece of Sargeras\' prison to the Maiden of Vigilance. If you had it you could move freely throughout the tomb, but I know not what became of the keeper and fear the worst.' WHERE `ID` = 47727;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Talestra the Vile' WHERE `ID` = 47728;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Child of Light and Shadow', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Turalyon to revive Xe\'ra.', `QuestDescription` = 'It is time, $n.$b$bXe\'ra is returned to us. We have Light\'s Heart. We have her Chosen One.$b$bCome, let us restore her. Let us forge a bright new path against our foes.$b$bSpeak to me when you are ready to begin.' WHERE `ID` = 47743;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Smoke, Meat, and Pretty Flowers', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain some Salted Venison Jerky, Fras\' Special Pipe Blend, and a Marigold Bouquet.', `QuestDescription` = 'Back of town\'s on lockdown, kid. And yes, I do have a key, but you\'re a stranger.$b$b<Emery pats his pocket gingerly.>$b$bListen, I\'d like to help you out. You\'ve got an honest look to you. Fetch me some venison, some pipe tobacco, and a bundle o\' yellow flowers, and I might be able to make an exception.' WHERE `ID` = 47744;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Yeah, Definitely for the Kids', `LogDescription` = 'Deliver the Marigold Bouquet to Orphan Matron Meliana.', `QuestDescription` = 'I don\'t know if you\'ve ever seen Orphan Matron Meliana before, but she is a goddess come down to humble Lordaeron. Her hair, those cheekbones, and...$b$b...and anyhow, these flowers are for the kids at the orphanage where she works. Tell Meliana that they\'re from me. For the kids.' WHERE `ID` = 47745;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Holing Up', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain a Refurbished Military Rifle, Basic Cloth Bandages, and Salted Venison Jerky.', `QuestDescription` = 'Did... did you see that? Prince Arthas just struck that person down in cold blood! Right in the middle of the street!$b$b<Meliana regains her composure.>$b$bI need to protect the children. Please, help us, visitors. I need a gun, bandages, and some venison jerky.$b$bChildren! Everybody, get into the house!' WHERE `ID` = 47746;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Fight Plague with Fire', `LogDescription` = 'Obtain a Flinty Firestarter and some Heavy Straw Rope.', `QuestDescription` = 'One final request of you, stranger. I\'ve seen what\'s happening outside, and I\'ve heard about this "plague". I don\'t want to go down without a fight.$b$bI have enough rum in the back of this bar to set this whole tavern on fire, but I don\'t have the tools to do it safely. Fetch me a flint and some rope, and I\'ll give you my key to the backstreets of Stratholme.' WHERE `ID` = 47747;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'FLAG - Holing Up Complete' WHERE `ID` = 47748;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'FLAG - Fight Plague With Fire Complete' WHERE `ID` = 47749;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'For Emery', `LogDescription` = 'Deliver the Salted Venison Jerky to Emery Neill.', `QuestDescription` = 'We do have plenty of food here, however. If you\'re braving the streets, please deliver this venison to that big dummy at the tavern.$b$bTell him it\'s from the kids.' WHERE `ID` = 47750;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Winter Veil Gift' WHERE `ID` = 47751;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Lightly Roasted', `LogDescription` = 'Use Light\'s Judgment to destroy the rubble blocking the entrance to the Xenedar.', `QuestDescription` = 'Can you hear me, $n? Good.$b$bLight\'s Judgment has been installed on the Vindicaar. We should be able to harness its power immediately.$b$bWe can use it both to clear the rubble blocking the Xenedar as well as destroy our enemies.$b$bAs with any new piece of technology, we should test it out. Thoroughly. I trust you have plenty of targets down there.' WHERE `ID` = 47754;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Death Metal Knight' WHERE `ID` = 47767;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Locating the Longshot', `LogDescription` = 'Find Baraat the Longshot.', `QuestDescription` = 'We\'re going to need a bigger gun if we hope to free Xe\'ra.$b$bOne of the other bunkers crashed closer to the Xenedar. If Baraat was on it, he will have already begun surveying the area. Perhaps he\'s found the main cannon of the ship.$b$bIf you head over that way, make sure he hasn\'t died, will you?' WHERE `ID` = 47771;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Sky Ablaze With Cannonfire', `LogDescription` = 'Destroy the Horde Siege Cannon.', `QuestDescription` = 'Oh! It\'s me! And $n, was it? I remember this!$b$bI seem to have found myself in the middle of a battle between the Horde and the Alliance, which wouldn\'t USUALLY be a big deal, except for that enormous cannon that seems to be trained on me anytime I try to fly away.$b$bThink you could take it out for me?' WHERE `ID` = 47772;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Sky Ablaze With Cannonfire', `LogDescription` = 'Destroy the Alliance Siege Cannon.', `QuestDescription` = 'Oh! It\'s me! And $n, was it? I remember this!$b$bI seem to have found myself in the middle of a battle between the Horde and the Alliance, which wouldn\'t USUALLY be a big deal, except for that enormous cannon that seems to be trained on me anytime I try to fly away.$b$bThink you could take it out for me?' WHERE `ID` = 47773;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Unsettled Power', `LogDescription` = 'Bring $1oa Writhing Essence to Arcanomancer Vridiel.', `QuestDescription` = 'The release of the energy previously trapped in the Nightwell has... complicated the influence of Aman\'Thul scattered about the Broken Isles. Sadly, the results of my previous work have been invalidated, much like the contents of this vial.$b$bI must understand what has caused this change! Please, bring me more samples so that I may continue my work. It goes without saying that you will be the beneficiary of any breakthroughs I may find.' WHERE `ID` = 47790;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Unsettled Power', `LogDescription` = 'Bring $1oa Writhing Essence to Arcanomancer Vridiel.', `QuestDescription` = 'It is deeply disconcerting that the power of Aman\'thul grows increasingly unstable. We must pursue this matter further.$b$bIs this volatility the result of the Legion\'s corruption? No, that is too recent an influence. Something else must have...$b$b<Vridiel trails off absentmindedly, not looking directly at you.>' WHERE `ID` = 47791;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Spoiled Sample', `LogDescription` = 'Bring the Spoiled Sample to Arcanomancer Vridiel in Dalaran on the Broken Isles.', `QuestDescription` = '<You pick up a vial of thick, inky liquid. Its contents react to your touch, boiling and popping furiously for a moment before settling down into a persistent glow. The substance resembles arcwine in this form, but the reaction reminds you of the breakdown of obliterum.$b$bYou tuck the vial in your bags. Someone in Dalaran familiar with the obliterum forge might know more.>' WHERE `ID` = 47793;
