UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Shadowcaster Voruun' WHERE `ID` = 47833;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Hand of Fate', `LogDescription` = 'Meet your escort to the Exodar at Bladefist Bay.', `QuestDescription` = '$p,\n\nWe have won many battles against the Burning Legion, but it is time to end this war once and for all. \n\nFinal preparations have begun to depart for Argus.\n\nMake haste to Bladefist Bay. A ship awaits you there to grant you and your allies passage to Azuremyst.' WHERE `ID` = 47835;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Recurring Madness' WHERE `ID` = 47844;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Sealing Fate: Marks of Honor' WHERE `ID` = 47851;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Flanking Maneuvers', `LogDescription` = 'Close 3 Legion Portals.', `QuestDescription` = 'I will take command of Fareeya\'s lieutenants and we will escort Velen to the Crest of Knowledge. His mission must not fail.$b$bWe face an old foe-- one the Army of the Light has encountered on numerous occasions. Talgath will try to block us in and prevent our retreat.$b$bYou must not let that happen. Find out how he is bringing in his forces and cut them off. All we need is time to get in and get out.$b$bWe are counting on you.' WHERE `ID` = 47853;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Wrath of the High Exarch', `LogDescription` = 'Disrupt the Legion forces in Arinor Gardens.', `QuestDescription` = 'Where the Legion is concerned, violence is always the answer.$b$b<Turalyon hefts his blade with a grim expression.>$b$bThey are between us and Velen. Nothing will stop them from finding him unless we act. Now is not the time to hold back.$b$bTogether we will sow chaos among their ranks.' WHERE `ID` = 47854;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'What Might Have Been', `LogDescription` = 'Witness Velen\'s memory.', `QuestDescription` = '<Velen continues to stare at the statue as he speaks.>$b$bThousands of years ago, when I was young, I made a choice.$b$bA choice that allowed my world to fall to ruin. A choice that made my people exiles. A choice that forever separated me from my beloved brothers.$b$b<Velen shakes his head.>$b$bI cannot leave, not yet. Not until I have had a chance to reflect.' WHERE `ID` = 47855;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Across the Universe', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Talgath.', `QuestDescription` = 'Talgath. There was a time I called him an ally, a friend.$b$bI put my trust in him when it came time to leave Argus. I asked him to call out to the others who would join me.$b$bI gave him all that he needed to betray me and slaughter my followers.$b$bI do not know what brought this hatred to lurk in his heart, but his machinations repeatedly forced my people to flee world after world. He made it his mission to hunt us across the universe.$b$bThis must end, $n. Talgath must die.', `PortraitGiverText` = 'Acting as Kil\'jaeden\'s unseen, unspoken master of the hunt, Talgath pursued the draenei across the stars.', `PortraitGiverName` = 'Talgath' WHERE `ID` = 47856;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Security: Engaged' WHERE `ID` = 47858;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Sealing Fate: Additional Marks of Honor' WHERE `ID` = 47864;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Sealing Fate: Piles of Marks of Honor' WHERE `ID` = 47865;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Two If By Sea', `LogDescription` = 'Speak to Lady Liadrin to set sail for the Exodar.', `QuestDescription` = 'The draenei have crafted a vessel to take us to Argus safely. They are gathering the invasion force on Azuremyst Isle as we speak. \n\nWe will join them there by sea. The Legion is no doubt keeping a close eye on the gateway to their world. We must retain the element of surprise.\n\nLet me know when you are ready.' WHERE `ID` = 47867;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Conservation of Magic', `LogDescription` = 'Stabilize 8 Erratic Power Conduits.', `QuestDescription` = 'I have an idea. This construct will be of use to us. We simply need to jolt it awake.$b$bWe once stored great quantities of energy in conduits throughout the Conservatory. They are still functional, but only just.$b$bTake this.$b$b<Y\'mera hands you a brightly glowing crystal.>$b$bIt will provide a small burst of magic that should help stabilize an erratic conduit. I think I have enough stored for eight or so.$b$bStabilizing a few should allow us to access the whole network.' WHERE `ID` = 47882;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Longest Vigil', `LogDescription` = 'Wake the Gatekeeper.', `QuestDescription` = 'It was a good thing we sought two sources of energy. Even with the conduits active, the construct has not stirred.$b$bIt has likely been inactive a long while. Perhaps as long as Mac\'Aree has floated above Argus.$b$bWhat a long, lonely vigil it must have been.$b$b<Y\'mera is silent for a moment as she peers at the construct.>$b$bGo ahead and jostle it a little. That combined with one last burst of magic ought to do the trick.' WHERE `ID` = 47883;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Speaker Calls', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Magni in the Krokul Hovel.', `QuestDescription` = 'Magni sent for you to meet him in the Krokul Hovel. He has found something that he believes could help us overcome the Legion\'s infinite armies.\n\nWe need every advantage we can muster if we are to see this war through. You should seek him out.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Meet Magni in the Krokul Hovel.' WHERE `ID` = 47889;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Visions of Torment', `LogDescription` = 'Activate the Sacred Stone to witness Argus\' vision with Magni.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'ve been hearin\' whispers ever since we got to Argus. They\'re just like Azeroth\'s, only... they ain\'t hers.\n\nI\'m convinced that Argus has a titan of its own that\'s reachin\' out to us!\n\nThe broken have a relic stowed away that\'s darn near holy to \'em. Hatuun says they hear whispers from it... I think it might have some sort o\' link to Argus itself!\n\nIt\'s just in this chamber. Let\'s see what we can learn.' WHERE `ID` = 47890;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Dire News', `LogDescription` = 'Return to Turalyon on the Vindicaar.', `QuestDescription` = 'Azeroth was right in sendin\' us here, $n. We have to stop whatever it is Sargeras is plannin\', or we may not have a home left to save when this is all over.$B$BYe should go back to Turalyon and let him know what ye\'ve seen. I\'ll stay here and see if I can\'t glean anything else that might help us.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Return to Turalyon on the Vindicaar.' WHERE `ID` = 47891;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Storming the Citadel', `LogDescription` = 'Travel to Destiny Point.', `QuestDescription` = 'We have already secured ground near Nath\'raxas Hold. It is one of the Legion\'s chief military fortifications on Argus.\n\nStriking it now, and hard, may be our only opportunity to tip the scales in our favor.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Join Turalyon at Destiny Point.' WHERE `ID` = 47892;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Bert\'s Bots', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Bert in a pet battle.', `QuestDescription` = 'If I\'m going to clean up Gnomeregan, I\'ve got to be ready to battle all manner of rat, roach, and potentially even the dreaded mutant rat-roach.\n\nWhat I\'m saying is that I need to put these bots to the test! A real, live-action field demo.\n\nAre your pets up for a code review?' WHERE `ID` = 47895;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Preserve the True Future', `LogDescription` = 'Stop the attacks from the Obsidian, Ruby, Azure, and Emerald Dragonshrines in one attempt of the Deaths of Chromie scenario.', `QuestDescription` = 'I know how this looks, $n. I\'m not asking for your help simply because I don\'t want to get killed.\n\nI need your help because this isn\'t how I\'m SUPPOSED to die. I will die - I\'ve seen it! - but it happens much later than this. Besides, meddling with the timeways for personal reasons - well, it goes against pretty much everything my dragonflight stands for.\n\nLet\'s stop all four of the dragonshrine attacks. That should do the trick.' WHERE `ID` = 47904;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Deaths of Chromie', `LogDescription` = 'Stop all eight attacks on Chromie in one attempt in the Deaths of Chromie scenario.', `QuestDescription` = 'It looks like we\'re going to have to stop all eight attacks on me. In one fifteen-minute span.\n\nEven to me, that doesn\'t seem like a lot of time.\n\nStill, if anybody can do it, it\'s us. Are you ready, $n?' WHERE `ID` = 47906;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 47920;
