UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'An Argus Roper', `LogDescription` = 'Return $1oa Wild Cragscalers to Lead Rider Jerek.', `QuestDescription` = 'My warriors stand no chance against even the smallest of the Legion\'s forces without our Cragscalers. If you can capture a few and bring them here, my warriors can better defend our people.' WHERE `ID` = 47967;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Scars of the Past', `LogDescription` = 'Recover an Invocation Array, Vindicator Plating, and a Judgment Core.', `QuestDescription` = 'The Army of the Light\'s warframes have won countless battles on Argus. Despite their power, not all who descend into the fray return.\n\nMy modifications to this frame should give us the edge we need, but several critical components are still missing.\n\nThere are remains of battles past in Nath\'raxas that we can still scavenge. If you can find the pieces I need, the Legion will feel our fury yet.' WHERE `ID` = 47986;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Preventive Measures', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Talisman of the Prophet to sanctify $1oa fallen Army of the Light warriors.', `QuestDescription` = 'There is no end to the Legion\'s depravity. Every battle won, every world conquered, yields more souls to fuel their war machine.\n\nThey have not yet defiled all of the fallen warriors in the hold, but I fear it is only a matter of time. Please, take this talisman with you into the hold and use it to sanctify any corpses you encounter.\n\nThey deserve a better fate.' WHERE `ID` = 47987;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Chaos Theory', `LogDescription` = 'Kill $1oa Nath\'raxxan Fleshcarvers, Nath\'raxxan Doomshots, or Ravenous Soulhunters, and $2oa Nathrezim Banelord.', `QuestDescription` = 'Despite their strength and their numbers, even the Burning Legion requires order to fight. Disrupt that order... and they fall like the rabble they are.\n\nThe plan is simple. Let chaos reign in their ranks, and the day will be ours.' WHERE `ID` = 47988;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Heralds of Apocalypse', `LogDescription` = 'Slay Lady Heretica and Mistress Apostriss.', `QuestDescription` = 'We\'ve been presented with a rare opportunity.\n\nOur scouts have spotted two shivarra priestesses in the western fel pools enhancing the Legion\'s war effort.\n\nThe inner circle of Sargeras\' chosen never leave the walls of Antorus. If we take them out, we might be able to sow fear among those closest to the Dark Titan.' WHERE `ID` = 47989;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Touch of Fel', `LogDescription` = 'Collect an Immaculate Felcore.', `QuestDescription` = 'Our warframe is almost operational! It just needs a good jolt to revitalize its systems.\n\nWarlocks in the pools below infuse pieces of Argus with fel energy to create living siege weapons. If you can extract one, we can use it to jumpstart the warframe\'s Judgment Core!' WHERE `ID` = 47990;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Dark Machinations', `LogDescription` = 'Dismantle $1oa Spires of Woe.', `QuestDescription` = 'Eredar are adept at manipulating the fel that courses through this world. Those who do not shape it into living weapons build other armaments, like the Spires of Woe.\n\nThe spires will make it difficult for even a small force to penetrate the main stronghold. We must dismantle enough of them to clear the way before we advance upon it.' WHERE `ID` = 47991;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Dawn of Justice', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Lightforged Warframe to take control of the Court of the Avenger.', `QuestDescription` = 'Thanks to your efforts, our enemy is in disarray and their defenses inoperable.\n\nWe must take the ground at the spire\'s base and tighten the noose around their commander\'s neck.\n\nYou have more than earned the honor to take the warframe into battle. We will follow your lead once the way is clear.' WHERE `ID` = 47992;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Lord of the Spire', `LogDescription` = 'Defeat Lord Nath\'raxas.', `QuestDescription` = 'Lord Nath\'raxas rules over this hold as thanks for his role in delivering Argus to the Legion many years ago.\n\nMake no mistake, he is powerful, but he has also grown overconfident in his seat.\n\nTake advantage of his hubris and make use of the warframe\'s firepower while you can. We will storm the courtyard shortly!', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Meet Turalyon on the Vindicaar.' WHERE `ID` = 47993;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Forming a Bond' WHERE `ID` = 47994;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Overt Ops', `LogDescription` = 'Locate Baraat the Longshot, Grand Vindicator Sorvos, and Blademaster Telaamon.', `QuestDescription` = 'My soldiers are out there, $n.$b$bI need you to find Baraat, Sorvos, and Telaamon. They were in the process of securing this area for Velen when the Legion came down on top of our heads.$b$bInform them that their orders are to regroup with the Prophet at once.$b$bThe time for subtlety has passed. There is a small army between us and them. Do what you must.$b$bLight keep you safe.' WHERE `ID` = 47995;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Limited Supplies', `LogDescription` = 'Go to the Petrified Forest and reclaim $1oa Used Vials.', `QuestDescription` = 'Hello, $n. It\'s good to see a fellow alchemist again.$b$bI\'ve been supplying our camp with necessary potions to deal with the demons, but lately I\'ve been running low on supplies. Normally when scouting parties go out, they return with empty vials, but as of late fewer have been returning.$b$bI try to recycle as much as I can, so you see, those vials are precious to me. If you\'d be willing to go out and retrieve them, I could show you what I\'ve been making to help combat the demons.' WHERE `ID` = 48002;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking the Trackers', `LogDescription` = 'Kill $1oa Feflame Scavengers at the Annihilan Pits.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, have I told you about my tracking potion? Our scouts use it to track demons, especially their "fiends".$b$bThose particular creatures tend to consume the astral glory in the area, making it difficult to replenish our stores of the herb.$b$bIf you could help thin their numbers out, it would greatly help us from having to search elsewhere for supplies. You can find many of them in the Annihilan Pits.$b$bI could also teach you the recipe for this potion for your effort.' WHERE `ID` = 48013;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Ascending Alchemy', `LogDescription` = 'Bring Funen $1oa Astral Glory, $2oa Primal Sargerite and an Infernal Alchemist Stone.', `QuestDescription` = 'I\'ve seen other alchemists come through our camp carrying interesting looking trinkets. I believe they refer to them as... "alchemist stones"?$b$bI can sense the power they radiate, but they appear fel-tainted. The herb that grows on this planet is particularly good at cleansing corruption. I use it to purify the primal sargerite that\'s often found amongst the herbs.$b$bI\'m certain that if we used a purified sargerite with one of those stones, we could elevate the power within it.' WHERE `ID` = 48016;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Chromie', `LogDescription` = 'Reach "Timehopper" friendship rank with Chromie in Dragonblight.', `QuestDescription` = '$n. Is that you?$b$bI\'m convinced that something unusual has happened in the timelines. I need your help!$b$bCome find me at Wyrmrest Temple, in Dragonblight, and I\'ll show you.' WHERE `ID` = 48021;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 48022;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Glory of Argus', `LogDescription` = 'Find someone on Argus who might be able to train you on how to handle Astral Glory.', `QuestDescription` = '<Amazed that anything so pure could continue to grow on this planet, you pick the flower from the ground. You feel a small power radiate from it and then vanish.>$b$b<As it falls apart in your hands, you wonder if anyone on this Light-forsaken place knows how to handle this precious herb.>' WHERE `ID` = 48027;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Youthful Resistance', `LogDescription` = 'Ask Funen about how to handle the younger Astral Glories.', `QuestDescription` = '<As you begin to gather the flowers, you realize that some of the younger blooms are still resistant to your approach and refuse to yield. Perhaps Funen might know more about how to handle the herb in its adolescent stages.>' WHERE `ID` = 48028;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Heart of It', `LogDescription` = 'Ask Funen about the shimmering roots of the Astral Glory.', `QuestDescription` = '<Having handled astral glory for a while now, you\'ve picked up on something interesting about its roots. Tightly wound in a cocoon, small flecks of light permeate through the cracks creating a shimmering effect.>$b$b<Perhaps Funen might be able to expand on the nature of these lights.>' WHERE `ID` = 48029;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'FLAG - Stratholme Scene Seen' WHERE `ID` = 48030;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'FLAG - Andorhal Scene Seen' WHERE `ID` = 48031;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'FLAG - Hyjal Scene Seen' WHERE `ID` = 48032;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'FLAG - Well of Eternity Scene Seen' WHERE `ID` = 48033;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Empyrium Deposit Chunk', `LogDescription` = 'Find someone on the Vindicaar who might be able to train you on how to mine an empyrium deposit.', `QuestDescription` = '<As you swing your pickaxe into the ore, it hits with a resounding thud, sending a small chunk of it to the ground. At this rate, it would take you all day to get a sufficient amount of ore from this deposit.>$b$b<Perhaps someone can give you some insight into how to mine this deposit properly.>' WHERE `ID` = 48034;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Angling For a Better Strike', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Khamir and see if there\'s a better way to mine empyrium deposits.', `QuestDescription` = '<Looking at the empyrium dust from taking down this deposit, you wonder if there\'s a way to prevent part of the deposit from shattering with each impact.>$b$b<Perhaps Khamir will know something further that he can share with you.>' WHERE `ID` = 48035;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Precision Perfected', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Khamir and see if there\'s an even better way to mine empyrium deposits.', `QuestDescription` = '<While you\'ve learned to extract as much of the deposit as you can, the core of the deposit is always left unusable. Looking closely, you can see where your strikes were causing fractures in its structure.>$b$b<One more lesson from Khamir might be needed to correct this problem.>' WHERE `ID` = 48036;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Empyrium Seam Chunk', `LogDescription` = 'Find someone at the Vindicaar who might be able to train you on how to mine empyrium seams.', `QuestDescription` = '<At first you thought the ore to have a mirrored surface, reflecting the starry space above you. After breaking off a chunk, you realize that the ore itself has a starry quality all of its own.>$b$b<Perhaps someone back at the Vindicaar can give you some insight on how to better extract these seams more efficiently.>' WHERE `ID` = 48037;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Don\'t Just Pick At It', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Khamir about a way to extract more ore from empyrium seams.', `QuestDescription` = '<Even though you\'ve learned to expose the ore, large chunks of it still seem to be embedded in the surrounding rock. Picking those pieces away may not result in the pure form of empyrium that you\'re looking for.>$b$b<Perhaps Khamir can show you a way to remove the ore from these sections of the seam.>' WHERE `ID` = 48038;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Balancing the Break', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Khamir about a way to extract even more ore from empyrium seams.', `QuestDescription` = '<Getting down to the root of the seam, you\'re left with nothing but small bits and pieces. Collectively though, they would have been enough to work with.>$b$b<Khamir might know a way to prevent this from happening.>' WHERE `ID` = 48039;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tainted Scraps', `LogDescription` = 'Find someone at the Vindicaar who might be able to train you on how to skin fiendish leather.', `QuestDescription` = '<As you begin to carefully remove the skin from the corpse, you notice it quickly becoming corrupted by the decay of the creature.>$b$b<Pulling away, you were only able to extract a small amount of leather and something foul smelling. Perhaps someone on the Vindicaar might know more about this foul hide.>' WHERE `ID` = 48040;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Larger Cut', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Enstraa about a better way to remove fiendish leather.', `QuestDescription` = '<While you\'ve become quicker at removing pieces of the hide, there is still much that is spoiled before you\'re able to remove it.>$b$b<Enstraa might have a better idea of how to remove more of the hide before it becomes tainted.>' WHERE `ID` = 48041;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Order of Operations', `LogDescription` = 'Speak with Enstraa about a better way to dissect the beasts of Argus.', `QuestDescription` = '<The skins have been more abundant, but you\'re only able to gather a couple teeth and claws before they take on the corruption.>$b$b<Unsure as to how to extract as many teeth and claws as possible, you find yourself wanting to have one last conversation with Enstraa back at the Vindicaar.>' WHERE `ID` = 48042;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'FLAG - Plating Cleared' WHERE `ID` = 48043;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'FLAG - Shields Cleared' WHERE `ID` = 48044;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Weigh Anchor', `LogDescription` = 'Bring the Crate of Felslate to Walcott Sutton at Stormwind Harbor.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, I was hoping to ask you for a small favor. The naval fleet at Stormwind Harbor have been requesting large amounts of felslate to help construct supplies for their ships.$b$bI\'m pretty busy here coordinating the gathering efforts and all my couriers are still out. I was wondering if you wouldn\'t mind taking that shipment over there to them?$b$bI heard there\'s a portal to Stormwind in the Greyfang Enclave here in Dalaran so it shouldn\'t be a long trip or anything.' WHERE `ID` = 48053;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Weigh Anchor', `LogDescription` = 'Bring the Crate of Felslate to Kruda Thunderhand at Bilgewater Harbor.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, I was hoping to ask you for a small favor. The naval fleet at Bilgewater Harbor have been requesting large amounts of felslate to help construct supplies for their ships.$b$bI\'m pretty busy here coordinating the gathering efforts and all my couriers are still out. I was wondering if you wouldn\'t mind taking that shipment over there to them?$b$bI heard there\'s a portal to Orgrimmar in the Windrunner\'s Sanctuary here in Dalaran so it shouldn\'t be a long trip or anything.' WHERE `ID` = 48054;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Empyrial Strength', `LogDescription` = 'Craft an Empyrial Breastplate. You can find the materials from gathering the ore from Argus, from other players, or from the auction house.', `QuestDescription` = 'I see my armor\'s caught your interest. It\'s made from the finest material on Argus: empyrium. I actually specialize in crafting breastplates.$b$bI could show you how to craft one, but you\'ll need to bring your own supplies, I\'m afraid. Our stores of the ore are low and we need all that we have.$b$bBut here are the plans so you\'ll know what you need to find...' WHERE `ID` = 48055;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Harsh Mistress', `LogDescription` = 'Help Hobart calibrate the Prototype Gravitational Reduction Slippers around Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = 'So there I was thinkin\' about how to get everyone ready for movin\' around Argul or whatever it\'s called, since I figure its gravity is different than ours, and I come up with a design for a device you slip onto your shoes, or hooves or whatever you\'re wearin\' down there.$b$bNext thing I hear, the gravity on that planet? Completely the same as ours!$b$bRegardless, I figure I could get the prototype workin\'. Mind givin\' me a hand? Maybe when we\'re done you can like, sell \'em to kids or somethin\'.' WHERE `ID` = 48056;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Mana-Etched Regalia' WHERE `ID` = 48058;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Der\'izu Armor' WHERE `ID` = 48059;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Righteous Battleplate' WHERE `ID` = 48060;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Obsidian Prowler\'s Garb' WHERE `ID` = 48061;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Scarlet Crusader' WHERE `ID` = 48062;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Goroth Intro' WHERE `ID` = 48064;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Extraterrestrial Exploration', `LogDescription` = 'Use the Ionized Geographical Recorder at the locations marked on your map. Return to Didi when you\'re finished.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, I hear you\'ve been over to that large green planet in the sky already. Swarming with demons too, I hear.$b$bI was thinking maybe we could put together another wormhole generator for it. Make it easier to zip around the planet.$b$bProblem is we need to get readings on the landscape, and I\'d go, but uh... well I need to stay here and run the shop. Can\'t leave it to these bozos to handle.$b$bHere, take this and get some readings for me, will ya?' WHERE `ID` = 48065;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Feast for Our Kin', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Baine Bloodhoof at Thunder Bluff in Mulgore.', `QuestDescription` = 'Ah, the Highmountain tauren. They have been our allies ever since we felled the Legion.\n\nAre you interested in hearing how they joined the Horde? It is quite the tale!\n\nIt all began with Baine Bloodhoof and Mayla Highmountain. Baine was hosting a great feast in Thunder Bluff to welcome the Highmountain tauren...', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Meet Baine Bloodhoof at Thunder Bluff in Mulgore.' WHERE `ID` = 48066;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Shadow Over Thunder Bluff', `LogDescription` = 'Slay $1oa Dark Tendrils and $2oa Shadows of Uul in Thunder Bluff.', `QuestDescription` = 'A dark force has descended upon us. I refuse to believe that the Highmountain are behind it.\n\nThe cacophony out there is disturbingly familiar. Could it be... \n\nNo! The minions of the Old Gods are attacking! We must fight for Thunder Bluff, $n!' WHERE `ID` = 48067;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'The Wrench Calls', `LogDescription` = 'Meet with Didi the Wrench in Dalaran.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, Didi the Wrench is looking for you back in Dalaran. You might want to see what she\'s working on. Pretty fancy stuff from what I heard.' WHERE `ID` = 48069;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Looming Over Me', `LogDescription` = 'Go to the Arinor Gardens and retrieve Khaela\'s Lightweave Loom.', `QuestDescription` = 'When I rallied to the Xenedar, I left behind a valuable tool. My lightweave loom. Without it, I\'m forced to labor for much longer to make garments of power for our allies.$b$bBut you are powerful, much more so than I. Perhaps you could do me a favor. Should you happen to be in the Arinor Gardens, could you retrieve my loom and return it to me?$b$bI\'d be more than willing to share my knowledge of sewing lightweave with you.' WHERE `ID` = 48074;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Colorful Key', `LogDescription` = 'Travel to Vorel\'s home and unlock his chest using each of the six gems that come from prospecting empyrium. Recover his jewelcrafting book and return to him on the Vindicaar.', `QuestDescription` = '$n, I hear you\'re a jewelcrafter. I too am a master cutter, but I fear my designs will be lost to the Legion.$b$bI hurried out of my home with the intention of returning, but I fear that may not be a possibility. You see, I left my most prized possession, a book of jewelcrafting designs.$b$bBut you, you\'re strong, you could fight your way into my home and recover my book!$b$bHowever, I locked it away in a special chest that requires the gems of this land to unlock. You\'ll need one of each to open it.' WHERE `ID` = 48075;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Crowning Achievement', `LogDescription` = 'Craft an Empyrial Crown for Vorel. You can find the materials from gathering and prospecting the ore from Argus, from other players, or from the auction house.', `QuestDescription` = 'With my book nearly being lost forever, it occurs to me that I shouldn\'t keep all this knowledge in one place. I would like to pass it along to you, $n.$b$bMy most recent designs are ones that I am particularly proud of. I call them Empyrial Crowns. Each one uses a different combination of gems to render different effects of power.$b$bLet me show you how to construct one and then I\'ll show you how different combinations of gems create different results.' WHERE `ID` = 48076;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Counterbalancing', `LogDescription` = 'Gather Fiendish Leather and Lightweave Cloth and use Enstraa\'s Tanning Oil to create $1oa Purified Fiendish Leather.', `QuestDescription` = 'In the past, I was able to make glorious items from the beasts of this land. But then the Legion came and wiped out all those amazing beasts.$b$bNow I\'m forced to use their polluted hides to craft armor for my allies. I have, however, found a way to remove their taint.$b$bThe cloth we use is made from special thread infused with Light energy. I devised an oil which when combined with the cloth purifies the leather and makes it usable.$b$bHere, take my oil and see for yourself.' WHERE `ID` = 48078;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Return to Highmountain', `LogDescription` = 'Meet Mayla Highmountain at Thunder Totem in Highmountain.', `QuestDescription` = 'Spiritwalker Ebonhorn remains in great danger. He and Mayla have returned to Highmountain, but I believe they still need our aid.\n\nLet us journey to Thunder Totem and do whatever we can to mend Ebonhorn. Perhaps our deeds will strengthen the bond between our peoples.', `QuestCompletionLog` = 'Meet Mayla Highmountain at Thunder Totem in Highmountain.' WHERE `ID` = 48079;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'A Floating Ruin', `LogDescription` = 'Travel to Mac\'Aree.', `QuestDescription` = 'We knew the Legion to be a formidable foe, but recent events demonstrate that we do not possess the necessary strength to continue. We have come too far to fail at this critical moment.$b$bI know of a relic on Mac\'Aree, my ancient home, that may be our salvation. We must take the Vindicaar beyond the surface of Argus, to the floating ruin suspended above us.$b$bPerhaps there we will find the salvation we so desperately need.' WHERE `ID` = 48081;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 48082;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 48083;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 48084;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle` = 'Tracking Quest' WHERE `ID` = 48085;
